                    </p>
                  </li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <h4>
                <a id=3D"idm140470535945424" name=3D"idm140470535945424"></=
a>Cyrus SASL Dependencies
              </h4>
              <h5>
                <a id=3D"idm140470535944736" name=3D"idm140470535944736"></=
a>Recommended
              </h5>
              <p class=3D"recommended">
                <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/=
blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#lmdb" title=3D"lmdb=
-0.9.31">lmdb-0.9.31</a>
              </p>
              <h5>
                <a id=3D"idm140470535942688" name=3D"idm140470535942688"></=
a>Optional
              </h5>
              <p class=3D"optional">
                <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/=
blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#linux-pam" title=3D=
"Linux-PAM-1.6.1">Linux-PAM-1.6.1</a>, <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://ww=
w.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.h=
tml#mitkrb" title=3D"MIT Kerberos V5-1.21.3">MIT Kerberos
                V5-1.21.3</a>, <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxf=
romscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#mari=
adb" title=3D"MariaDB-10.11.8">MariaDB-10.11.8</a> or <a class=3D"ulink" hr=
ef=3D"https://www.mysql.com/">MySQL</a>, <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://=
www.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks=
.html#openldap" title=3D"OpenLDAP-2.6.8">OpenLDAP-2.6.8</a>,
                <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/=
blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#postgresql" title=
=3D"PostgreSQL-16.4">PostgreSQL-16.4</a>, <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https:/=
/www.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunk=
s.html#sphinx" title=3D"Sphinx-8.0.2">sphinx-8.0.2</a>, <a class=3D"xref" h=
ref=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.=
2-sysv-nochunks.html#sqlite" title=3D"SQLite-3.46.1">SQLite-3.46.1</a>, <a =
class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://anduin.linuxfromscratch.org/BLFS/bdb/db-5.3=
.28.tar.gz">
                Berkeley DB</a> (deprecated), <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"ht=
tps://stuff.mit.edu/afs/net.mit.edu/project/attic/krb4/">krb4</a>,
                <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://dmalloc.com/">Dmalloc</a=
>, and
