              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Introduction to GPGME
              </h3>
              <p>
                The <span class=3D"application">GPGME</span> package is a C
                library that allows cryptography support to be added to a
                program. It is designed to make access to public key crypto
                engines like <span class=3D"application">GnuPG</span> or Gp=
gSM
                easier for applications. <span class=3D"application">GPGME<=
/span> provides a high-level crypto API
                for encryption, decryption, signing, signature verification
                and key management.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
