bnsl-2.0.1">libnsl-2.0.1</a>, <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfr=
omscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#libti=
rpc" title=3D"libtirpc-1.3.5">libtirpc-1.3.5</a>,
                <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/=
blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#rpcsvc-proto" title=
