          <div class=3D"titlepage">
            <div>
              <div>
                <h2 class=3D"title">
                  <a id=3D"liboauth" name=3D"liboauth"></a>liboauth-1.0.3
                </h2>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class=3D"sect1" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
            <div class=3D"package" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Introduction to liboauth
              </h3>
              <p>
                <span class=3D"application">liboauth</span> is a collection=
 of
                POSIX-C functions implementing the OAuth Core RFC 5849
                standard. Liboauth provides functions to escape and encode
                parameters according to OAuth specification and offers
                high-level functionality to sign requests or verify OAuth
                signatures as well as perform HTTP requests.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
              </p>
              <h4>
                <a id=3D"idm140470535055024" name=3D"idm140470535055024"></=
a>Package Information
              </h4>
              <div class=3D"itemizedlist">
                <ul class=3D"compact">
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download (HTTP): <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://d=
ownloads.sourceforge.net/liboauth/liboauth-1.0.3.tar.gz">
                      https://downloads.sourceforge.net/liboauth/liboauth-1=
.0.3.tar.gz</a>
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download MD5 sum: 689b46c2b3ab1a39735ac33f714c4f7f
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download size: 496 KB
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Estimated disk space required: 3.5 MB
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Estimated build time: less than 0.1 SBU
                    </p>
                  </li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <h4>
                <a id=3D"idm140470535047600" name=3D"idm140470535047600"></=
a>Additional Downloads
              </h4>
              <div class=3D"itemizedlist">
                <ul class=3D"compact">
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Required patch for use with openssl: <a class=3D"ulin=
k" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/patches/blfs/12.2/liboauth-1.0.=
3-openssl-1.1.0-3.patch">
                      https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/patches/blfs/12.2/li=
boauth-1.0.3-openssl-1.1.0-3.patch</a>
                    </p>
                  </li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <h4>
                <a id=3D"idm140470535044832" name=3D"idm140470535044832"></=
a>liboauth Dependencies
              </h4>
              <h5>
                <a id=3D"idm140470535044144" name=3D"idm140470535044144"></=
a>Required
              </h5>
              <p class=3D"required">
                <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/=
blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#curl" title=3D"cURL=
-8.9.1">cURL-8.9.1</a>
              </p>
              <h5>
                <a id=3D"idm140470535042160" name=3D"idm140470535042160"></=
a>Optional
              </h5>
              <p class=3D"optional">
                <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/=
blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#nss" title=3D"NSS-3=
.103">nss-3.103</a>
                and <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.=
org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#doxygen" title=
=3D"Doxygen-1.12.0">Doxygen-1.12.0</a> (to build documentation)
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class=3D"installation" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Installation of liboauth
              </h3>
              <p>
                Apply a patch for the current version of openssl:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">patch -Np1 -i=
 ../liboauth-1.0.3-openssl-1.1.0-3.patch</kbd></pre>
              <p>
                Install <span class=3D"application">liboauth</span> by runn=
ing
                the following commands:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">./configure -=
-prefix=3D/usr --disable-static &amp;&amp;
make</kbd></pre>
              <p>
                If you wish to build the documentation (needs <a class=3D"x=
ref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BO=
OK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#doxygen" title=3D"Doxygen-1.12.0">Doxygen-1.12.0=
</a>),
                issue:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">make dox</kbd=
></pre>
              <p>
                To test the results, issue: <span class=3D"command"><strong=
>make check</strong></span>.
              </p>
              <p>
                Now, as the <code class=3D"systemitem">root</code> user:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"root"><kbd class=3D"command">make install</kbd>=
</pre>
              <p>
                If you have previously built the documentation, install it =
by
                running the following commands as the <code class=3D"system=
item">root</code> user:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"root"><kbd class=3D"command">install -v -dm755 =
/usr/share/doc/liboauth-1.0.3 &amp;&amp;
cp -rv doc/html/* /usr/share/doc/liboauth-1.0.3</kbd></pre>
            </div>
            <div class=3D"commands" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Command Explanations
              </h3>
              <p>
                <em class=3D"parameter"><code>--disable-static</code></em>:
                This switch prevents installation of static versions of the
                libraries.
              </p>
              <p>
                <code class=3D"option">--enable-nss</code>: Use this switch=
 if
                you want to use Mozilla NSS instead of <span class=3D"appli=
cation">OpenSSL</span>.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class=3D"content" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
