ithub.com/libpwquality/libpwquality/releases/download/libpwquality-1.4.5/li=
bpwquality-1.4.5.tar.bz2">
                      https://github.com/libpwquality/libpwquality/releases=
/download/libpwquality-1.4.5/libpwquality-1.4.5.tar.bz2</a>
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download MD5 sum: 6b70e355269aef0b9ddb2b9d17936f21
                    </p>
                  </li>
