n class=3D"phrase">Init
                        Script</span>
                      </h4>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <p>
                  If you want to start <span class=3D"application">Kerberos=
</span> services at boot, install the
                  <code class=3D"filename">/etc/rc.d/init.d/krb5</code> ini=
t
                  script included in the <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://=
www.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks=
.html#bootscripts" title=3D"BLFS Boot Scripts">blfs-bootscripts-20240416</a=
>
                  package using the following command:
                </p>
                <pre class=3D"root"><kbd class=3D"command">make install-krb=
5</kbd></pre>
              </div>
