              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Introduction to Nettle
              </h3>
              <p>
                The <span class=3D"application">Nettle</span> package conta=
ins
                a low-level cryptographic library that is designed to fit
                easily in many contexts.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
              </p>
