                Introduction to p11-kit
              </h3>
              <p>
                The <span class=3D"application">p11-kit</span> package prov=
ides
                a way to load and enumerate PKCS #11 (a Cryptographic Token
                Interface Standard) modules.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
              </p>
