                  </tbody>
                </table>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class=3D"titlepage">
            <div>
              <div>
                <h2 class=3D"title">
                  <a id=3D"fuse3" name=3D"fuse3"></a>Fuse-3.16.2
                </h2>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class=3D"sect1" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
            <div class=3D"package" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Introduction to Fuse
              </h3>
              <p>
                <span class=3D"application">FUSE</span> (Filesystem in
                Userspace) is a simple interface for userspace programs to
                export a virtual filesystem to the Linux kernel. <span clas=
s=3D"application">Fuse</span> also aims to provide a secure
                method for non privileged users to create and mount their o=
wn
                filesystem implementations.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
              </p>
              <h4>
                <a id=3D"idm140470533310144" name=3D"idm140470533310144"></=
a>Package Information
              </h4>
