>
                    <span class=3D"segbody">libfuse3.so</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class=3D"seg">
                    <strong class=3D"segtitle">Installed Directory:</strong=
>
                    <span class=3D"segbody">/usr/include/fuse3 and
                    /usr/share/doc/fuse-3.16.2</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
