          </div>
          <div class=3D"sect1" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
            <div class=3D"package" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Introduction to LVM2
              </h3>
              <p>
                The <span class=3D"application">LVM2</span> package is a se=
t of
                tools that manage logical partitions. It allows spanning of
                file systems across multiple physical disks and disk
                partitions and provides for dynamic growing or shrinking of
                logical partitions, mirroring and low storage footprint
                snapshots.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
              </p>
              <h4>
                <a id=3D"idm140470533157808" name=3D"idm140470533157808"></=
a>Package Information
              </h4>
              <div class=3D"itemizedlist">
                <ul class=3D"compact">
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download (HTTP): <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://s=
ourceware.org/ftp/lvm2/LVM2.2.03.26.tgz">https://sourceware.org/ftp/lvm2/LV=
M2.2.03.26.tgz</a>
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download MD5 sum: 276620e7071b4f0ba18b0c5cf2150c79
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download size: 2.7 MB
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Estimated disk space required: 38 MB (add 20 MB for
                      tests; transient files can grow up to around 300 MB i=
n
                      the /tmp directory during tests)
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Estimated build time: 0.3 SBU (add 9 to 48 SBU for
                      tests, depending on disk speed and whether ram block
                      device is enabled in the kernel)
                    </p>
                  </li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <h4>
                <a id=3D"idm140470533150384" name=3D"idm140470533150384"></=
a>LVM2
                Dependencies
              </h4>
              <h5>
                <a id=3D"idm140470533149696" name=3D"idm140470533149696"></=
a>Required
              </h5>
              <p class=3D"required">
                <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/=
blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#libaio" title=3D"li=
baio-0.3.113">libaio-0.3.113</a>
              </p>
