            <div class=3D"installation" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Installation of gptfdisk
              </h3>
              <p>
                The <span class=3D"application">gptfdisk</span> package com=
es
                with a rudimentary <code class=3D"filename">Makefile</code>=
.
                First we update it to provide a simple build and install
                interface and fix the location of a header file and fix som=
e
                minor location issues. Install <span class=3D"application">=
gptfdisk</span> by running the following
                commands:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">patch -Np1 -i=
 ../gptfdisk-1.0.10-convenience-1.patch &amp;&amp;
sed -i 's|ncursesw/||' gptcurses.cc &amp;&amp;
sed -i 's|sbin|usr/sbin|' Makefile  &amp;&amp;

make</kbd></pre>
              <p>
                To test the results, issue: <span class=3D"command"><strong=
>make test</strong></span>.
              </p>
              <p>
                Now, as the <code class=3D"systemitem">root</code> user:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"root"><kbd class=3D"command">make install</kbd>=
</pre>
            </div>
            <div class=3D"commands" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Command Explanations
              </h3>
              <p>
                <span class=3D"command"><strong>patch -Np1 ...</strong></sp=
an>:
                This patch modifies the <code class=3D"filename">Makefile</=
code> file so that it provides an
                <span class=3D"quote">=E2=80=9C<span class=3D"quote">instal=
l</span>=E2=80=9D</span> target.
              </p>
            </div>
