          <div class=3D"sect1" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
            <div class=3D"package" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Introduction to parted
              </h3>
              <p>
                The <span class=3D"application">Parted</span> package is a =
disk
                partitioning and partition resizing tool.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
              </p>
              <h4>
                <a id=3D"idm140470532682480" name=3D"idm140470532682480"></=
a>Package Information
              </h4>
              <div class=3D"itemizedlist">
                <ul class=3D"compact">
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download (HTTP): <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://f=
tp.gnu.org/gnu/parted/parted-3.6.tar.xz">https://ftp.gnu.org/gnu/parted/par=
ted-3.6.tar.xz</a>
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download MD5 sum: 93d2d8f22baebc5eb65b85da05a79e4e
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download size: 1.8 MB
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
