a>Parted Dependencies
              </h4>
              <h5>
                <a id=3D"idm140470532672672" name=3D"idm140470532672672"></=
a>Recommended
              </h5>
              <p class=3D"recommended">
                <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/=
blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#lvm2" title=3D"LVM2=
-2.03.26">LVM2-2.03.26</a> (device-mapper, required if
                building <span class=3D"application">udisks</span>)
              </p>
              <h5>
                <a id=3D"idm140470532669904" name=3D"idm140470532669904"></=
a>Optional
              </h5>
              <p class=3D"optional">
                <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/=
blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#dosfstools" title=
=3D"dosfstools-4.2">dosfstools-4.2</a>, <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://w=
ww.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.=
html#texlive" title=3D"texlive-20240312-source">texlive-20240312</a> (or <a=
 class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/sta=
ble/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#tl-installer" title=3D"install-tl-unx=
">install-tl-unx</a>), and <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://metacpan.org/=
pod/Digest::CRC">Digest::CRC</a>
                (for tests)
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class=3D"kernel" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                <a id=3D"parted-kernel" name=3D"parted-kernel"></a>Optional
                Kernel Configuration for Tests
              </h3>
              <p>
                About 20 % more tests are run if the following kernel modul=
e
                is built:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"screen"><span class=3D"blue">D</span>evice Driv=
ers ---&gt;
  <span class=3D"blue">S</span>CSI device support ---&gt;
    [*] <span class=3D"blue">S</span>CSI low-level drivers ---&gt;         =
                     [SCSI_LOWLEVEL]
      &lt;M&gt; <span class=3D"blue">S</span>CSI debugging host and device =
simulator                  [SCSI_DEBUG]</pre>
            </div>
            <div class=3D"installation" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Installation of parted
              </h3>
              <p>
                Install <span class=3D"application">Parted</span> by runnin=
g
                the following commands:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">./configure -=
-prefix=3D/usr --disable-static &amp;&amp;
make &amp;&amp;

make -C doc html                                       &amp;&amp;
makeinfo --html      -o doc/html       doc/parted.texi &amp;&amp;
makeinfo --plaintext -o doc/parted.txt doc/parted.texi</kbd></pre>
              <p>
                If you have <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfrom=
scratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#texlive=
" title=3D"texlive-20240312-source">texlive-20240312</a> installed and
                wish to create PDF and Postscript documentation issue the
                following commands:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">cp build-aux/=
texinfo.tex doc               &amp;&amp;
texi2pdf -o doc/parted.pdf doc/parted.texi &amp;&amp;
texi2dvi -o doc/parted.dvi doc/parted.texi &amp;&amp;
dvips    -o doc/parted.ps  doc/parted.dvi</kbd></pre>
              <p>
                To test the results, issue, as the <code class=3D"systemite=
m">root</code> user:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"root"><kbd class=3D"command">make check</kbd></=
pre>
              <div class=3D"admon note">
                <h3>
                  Note
                </h3>
                <p>
                  Many tests are skipped if not run as the <code class=3D"s=
ystemitem">root</code> user.
                </p>
