                running the following commands:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">./configure -=
-prefix=3D/usr           \
            --sysconfdir=3D/etc       \
            --with-initscriptdir=3Dno \
            --with-libsystemd=3Dno    \
            --docdir=3D/usr/share/doc/smartmontools-7.4 &amp;&amp;
make</kbd></pre>
