            <div class=3D"installation" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Installation of xfsprogs
              </h3>
              <p>
                Install <span class=3D"application">xfsprogs</span> by runn=
ing
                the following commands:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">make DEBUG=3D=
-DNDEBUG     \
     INSTALL_USER=3Droot  \
     INSTALL_GROUP=3Droot</kbd></pre>
              <p>
                This package does not come with a test suite.
              </p>
              <p>
                Now, as the <code class=3D"systemitem">root</code> user:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"root"><kbd class=3D"command">make PKG_DOC_DIR=
=3D/usr/share/doc/xfsprogs-6.9.0 install     &amp;&amp;
make PKG_DOC_DIR=3D/usr/share/doc/xfsprogs-6.9.0 install-dev &amp;&amp;

rm -rfv /usr/lib/libhandle.{a,la}</kbd></pre>
            </div>
