              <p>
                Build <span class=3D"application">efibootmgr</span> with th=
e
                following commands:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">make EFIDIR=
=3DLFS EFI_LOADER=3Dgrubx64.efi</kbd></pre>
              <p>
                This package does not have a test suite.
              </p>
              <p>
                Now, as the <code class=3D"systemitem">root</code> user:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"root"><kbd class=3D"command">make install EFIDI=
R=3DLFS</kbd></pre>
            </div>
