              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Command Explanations
              </h3>
              <p>
                <em class=3D"parameter"><code>EFIDIR=3DLFS</code></em>: Thi=
s
                option specifies the distro's subdirectory name under
                <code class=3D"filename">/boot/efi/EFI</code>. The building
                system of this package needs it to be set explicitly.
              </p>
              <p>
                <em class=3D"parameter"><code>EFI_LOADER=3Dgrubx64.efi</cod=
e></em>: This
                option specifies the name of the default EFI boot loader. I=
t
                is set to match the EFI boot loader provided by GRUB .
              </p>
            </div>
