              <p class=3D"recommended">
                <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/=
blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#efibootmgr" title=
=3D"efibootmgr-18">efibootmgr-18</a> (runtime) and <a class=3D"xref" href=
=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-s=
ysv-nochunks.html#freetype2" title=3D"FreeType-2.13.3">FreeType-2.13.3</a>
              </p>
              <h5>
                <a id=3D"idm140470532213936" name=3D"idm140470532213936"></=
a>Optional
              </h5>
              <p class=3D"optional">
                <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/=
blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#lvm2" title=3D"LVM2=
-2.03.26">LVM2-2.03.26</a> and <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxf=
romscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#fuse=
3" title=3D"Fuse-3.16.2">Fuse-3.16.2</a>
              </p>
