ps://www.linuxfromscratch.org/lfs/view/12.2/chapter08/grub.html#contents-gR=
UB">
                ../../../../lfs/view/12.2/chapter08/grub.html#contents-gRUB=
</a>.
              </p>
              <p>
                Listed below are the newly installed programs along with
