  <span class=3D"blue">D</span>OS/FAT/EXFAT/NT Filesystems ---&gt;
    &lt;*/M&gt; <span class=3D"blue">V</span>FAT (Windows-95) fs support   =
                              [VFAT_FS]
  <span class=3D"blue">P</span>seudo filesystems ---&gt;
