            <div class=3D"installation" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Installation of Gedit
              </h3>
              <p>
                First, build the gfls library:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">tar -xf ../li=
bgedit-gfls-0.1.0.tar.xz &amp;&amp;
pushd libgedit-gfls-0.1.0             &amp;&amp;

mkdir gfls-build &amp;&amp;
cd    gfls-build &amp;&amp;

meson setup --prefix=3D/usr       \
            --buildtype=3Drelease \
            -D gtk_doc=3Dfalse    \
            ..                  &amp;&amp;
ninja</kbd></pre>
              <p>
                To test the results, run: <span class=3D"command"><strong>n=
inja
                test</strong></span>.
              </p>
              <p>
                Now, as the <code class=3D"systemitem">root</code> user:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"root"><kbd class=3D"command">ninja install &amp=
;&amp;
popd</kbd></pre>
              <p>
                Second, build the tepl library:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">tar -xf ../li=
bgedit-tepl-6.10.0.tar.xz &amp;&amp;
pushd libgedit-tepl-6.10.0             &amp;&amp;

mkdir tepl-build &amp;&amp;
cd    tepl-build &amp;&amp;

meson setup --prefix=3D/usr       \
            --buildtype=3Drelease \
            -D gtk_doc=3Dfalse    \
            ..                  &amp;&amp;
ninja</kbd></pre>
              <p>
                To test the results, run: <span class=3D"command"><strong>n=
inja
                test</strong></span>.
              </p>
              <p>
                Now, as the <code class=3D"systemitem">root</code> user:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"root"><kbd class=3D"command">ninja install &amp=
;&amp;
popd</kbd></pre>
              <p>
                Finally, install <span class=3D"application">Gedit</span> b=
y
                running the following commands:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">mkdir gedit-b=
uild &amp;&amp;
cd    gedit-build &amp;&amp;

meson setup --prefix=3D/usr       \
            --buildtype=3Drelease \
            -D gtk_doc=3Dfalse    \
            .. &amp;&amp;
ninja</kbd></pre>
              <p>
                To test the results, issue: <span class=3D"command"><strong=
>ninja test</strong></span>.
              </p>
              <p>
                Now, as the <code class=3D"systemitem">root</code> user:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"root"><kbd class=3D"command">ninja install</kbd=
></pre>
              <div class=3D"admon note">
                <h3>
                  Note
                </h3>
                <p>
                  If you installed the package to your system using a
                  <span class=3D"quote">=E2=80=9C<span class=3D"quote">DEST=
DIR</span>=E2=80=9D</span> method, <code class=3D"filename">/usr/share/glib=
-2.0/schemas/gschemas.compiled</code>
                  was not updated/created. Create (or update) the file usin=
g
                  the following command as the <code class=3D"systemitem">r=
oot</code> user:
                </p>
                <pre class=3D"root"><kbd class=3D"command">glib-compile-sch=
emas /usr/share/glib-2.0/schemas</kbd></pre>
              </div>
            </div>
