        <div class=3D"titlepage">
          <div>
            <div>
              <h2 class=3D"title">
                <a id=3D"postlfs-shells" name=3D"postlfs-shells"></a>Chapte=
r&nbsp;7.&nbsp;Shells
              </h2>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class=3D"chapter" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
          <p>
            We are all familiar with the Bourne Again SHell, but there are
            two other user interfaces that are considered useful modern
            shells =E2=80=93 the Berkeley Unix C shell and the Korn shell. =
This
            chapter installs packages compatible with these additional shel=
l
            types.
          </p>
          <div class=3D"titlepage">
            <div>
              <div>
                <h2 class=3D"title">
                  <a id=3D"dash" name=3D"dash"></a>Dash-0.5.12
                </h2>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class=3D"sect1" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
            <div class=3D"package" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Introduction to Dash
              </h3>
              <p>
                <span class=3D"application">Dash</span> is a POSIX complian=
t
                shell. It can be installed as /bin/sh or as the default she=
ll
                for either <code class=3D"systemitem">root</code> or a seco=
nd
                user with a userid of 0. It depends on fewer libraries than
                the <span class=3D"application">Bash</span> shell and is
                therefore less likely to be affected by an upgrade problem =
or
                disk failure. <span class=3D"application">Dash</span> is al=
so
                useful for checking that a script is completely compatible
                with POSIX syntax.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
              </p>
              <h4>
                <a id=3D"idm140470531327456" name=3D"idm140470531327456"></=
a>Package Information
              </h4>
              <div class=3D"itemizedlist">
                <ul class=3D"compact">
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download (HTTP): <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"http://go=
ndor.apana.org.au/~herbert/dash/files/dash-0.5.12.tar.gz">
                      http://gondor.apana.org.au/~herbert/dash/files/dash-0=
.5.12.tar.gz</a>
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download MD5 sum: 57222b768b84003ea4b801e5d5e0e52b
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download size: 244 KB
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Estimated disk space required: 2.9 MB
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Estimated build time: less than 0.1 SBU
                    </p>
                  </li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <h4>
                <a id=3D"idm140470531320032" name=3D"idm140470531320032"></=
a>Dash
                Dependencies
              </h4>
              <h5>
                <a id=3D"idm140470531319344" name=3D"idm140470531319344"></=
a>Optional
              </h5>
              <p class=3D"optional">
                <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://www.thrysoee.dk/editline=
/">libedit</a> (command line
                editor library)
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class=3D"installation" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Installation of Dash
              </h3>
              <p>
                Install <span class=3D"application">Dash</span> by running =
the
                following commands:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">./configure -=
-bindir=3D/bin --mandir=3D/usr/share/man &amp;&amp;
make</kbd></pre>
              <p>
                This package does not come with a test suite.
              </p>
              <p>
                Now, as the <code class=3D"systemitem">root</code> user:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"root"><kbd class=3D"command">make install</kbd>=
</pre>
              <p>
                If you would like to make <span class=3D"command"><strong>d=
ash</strong></span> the default
                <span class=3D"command"><strong>sh</strong></span>, recreat=
e
                the <code class=3D"filename">/bin/sh</code> symlink as the
                <code class=3D"systemitem">root</code> user:
              </p>
              <div class=3D"admon note">
                <h3>
                  Note
                </h3>
                <p>
                  If you create the symbolic link from <span class=3D"comma=
nd"><strong>dash</strong></span> to <span class=3D"command"><strong>sh</str=
ong></span>, you will need to
                  reset the link to <span class=3D"command"><strong>bash</s=
trong></span> to build LFS.
                </p>
              </div>
              <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">ln -svf dash =
/bin/sh</kbd></pre>
            </div>
            <div class=3D"commands" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Command Explanations
              </h3>
              <p>
                <em class=3D"parameter"><code>--bindir=3D/bin</code></em>: =
This
                parameter places the <span class=3D"command"><strong>dash</=
strong></span> binary into the root
                filesystem.
              </p>
              <p>
                <code class=3D"option">--with-libedit</code>: To compile
                <span class=3D"application">Dash</span> with libedit suppor=
t.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class=3D"configuration" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Configuring Dash
              </h3>
              <div class=3D"sect3" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
                <div class=3D"titlepage">
                  <div>
                    <div>
                      <h4 class=3D"title">
                        <a id=3D"dash-config" name=3D"dash-config"></a>Conf=
ig
                        Files
                      </h4>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <p>
                  <span class=3D"application">Dash</span> sources <code cla=
ss=3D"filename">/etc/profile</code> and <code class=3D"filename">~/.profile=
</code>
                </p>
              </div>
              <div class=3D"sect3" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
                <div class=3D"titlepage">
                  <div>
                    <div>
                      <h4 class=3D"title">
                        <a id=3D"idm140470531289824" name=3D"idm14047053128=
9824"></a>Configuration Information
                      </h4>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <p>
                  Update <code class=3D"filename">/etc/shells</code> to inc=
lude
                  the <span class=3D"application">Dash</span> shell by issu=
ing
                  the following command as the <code class=3D"systemitem">r=
oot</code> user:
                </p>
                <pre class=3D"root"><kbd class=3D"command">cat &gt;&gt; /et=
c/shells &lt;&lt; "EOF"
<code class=3D"literal">/bin/dash</code>
EOF</kbd></pre>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class=3D"content" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Contents
              </h3>
              <div class=3D"segmentedlist">
                <div class=3D"seglistitem">
                  <div class=3D"seg">
                    <strong class=3D"segtitle">Installed Program:</strong>
                    <span class=3D"segbody">dash</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class=3D"seg">
                    <strong class=3D"segtitle">Installed Libraries:</strong=
>
                    <span class=3D"segbody">None</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class=3D"seg">
                    <strong class=3D"segtitle">Installed Directories:</stro=
ng>
                    <span class=3D"segbody">None</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class=3D"variablelist">
                <h4>
                  <a id=3D"idm140470531279408" name=3D"idm140470531279408">=
</a>Short Description
                </h4>
                <table border=3D"0" class=3D"variablelist">
