        <div class=3D"titlepage">
          <div>
            <div>
              <h2 class=3D"title">
                <a id=3D"postlfs-virtualization" name=3D"postlfs-virtualiza=
tion"></a>Chapter&nbsp;8.&nbsp;Virtualization
              </h2>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class=3D"chapter" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
          <p>
            Virtualization allows running a complete operating system, or
            virtual machine (VM), within another operating environment as a
            task. There are several commercial and open source environments
            that either emulate another processor or utilize the hardware
            virtualization features of the host processor.
          </p>
