            <div class=3D"installation" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Installation of Abseil-cpp
              </h3>
              <p>
                Install <span class=3D"application">Abseil-cpp</span> by
                running the following commands:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">mkdir build &=
amp;&amp;
cd    build &amp;&amp;

cmake -D CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=3D/usr \
      -D CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=3DRelease  \
      -D ABSL_PROPAGATE_CXX_STD=3DON \
      -D BUILD_SHARED_LIBS=3DON      \
      -G Ninja ..                  &amp;&amp;
ninja</kbd></pre>
              <p>
                This package does not come with a test suite.
              </p>
              <p>
                Now, as the <code class=3D"systemitem">root</code> user:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"root"><kbd class=3D"command">ninja install</kbd=
></pre>
