              </h3>
              <p>
                Install <span class=3D"application">AppStream</span> by run=
ning
                the following commands:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">mkdir build &=
amp;&amp;
cd    build &amp;&amp;

meson setup --prefix=3D/usr       \
            --buildtype=3Drelease \
            -D apidocs=3Dfalse    \
            -D stemming=3Dfalse   .. &amp;&amp;
ninja</kbd></pre>
              <p>
                To test the results, issue: <span class=3D"command"><strong=
>ninja test</strong></span>.
              </p>
              <p>
                Now, as the <code class=3D"systemitem">root</code> user:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"root"><kbd class=3D"command">ninja install &amp=
;&amp;
mv -v /usr/share/doc/appstream{,-1.0.3}</kbd></pre>
            </div>
            <div class=3D"commands" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Command Explanations
              </h3>
              <p>
                <em class=3D"parameter"><code>--buildtype=3Drelease</code><=
/em>:
                Specify a buildtype suitable for stable releases of the
                package, as the default may produce unoptimized binaries.
              </p>
              <p>
                <em class=3D"parameter"><code>-D apidocs=3Dfalse</code></em=
>:
                This switch disables building the API documentation. Remove
                it if you have <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxf=
romscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#gi-d=
ocgen" title=3D"Gi-DocGen-2024.1">Gi-DocGen-2024.1</a> installed and wish t=
o
                regenerate the API documentation. When the API documentatio=
n
                is not regenerated, a pre-built copy is installed anyway.
              </p>
              <p>
                <em class=3D"parameter"><code>-D stemming=3Dfalse</code></e=
m>:
                This switch disables stemming support. Remove this switch i=
f
                you have <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://github.com/zvel=
o/libstemmer">libstemmer</a>
                installed and want faster searches.
              </p>
              <p>
                <code class=3D"option">-D qt5=3Dtrue</code>: Use this optio=
n if
                you have <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscr=
atch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#qt5-compon=
ents" title=3D"qt5-components-5.15.14">qt5-components-5.15.14</a> installed
                and you want to build support for Qt-5 applications into th=
is
                package.
              </p>
              <p>
                <code class=3D"option">-D qt=3Dtrue</code>: Use this option=
 if
                you have <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscr=
atch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#qt6" title=
=3D"Qt-6.7.2">Qt-6.7.2</a> installed and you want to build
                support for Qt6 applications into this package. This option
                conflicts with <code class=3D"option">-D qt5=3Dtrue</code>.
              </p>
