ratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#openldap"=
 title=3D"OpenLDAP-2.6.8">OpenLDAP-2.6.8</a>, use this switch to
                compile the <code class=3D"filename">apr_ldap.so</code> plu=
gin.
