              <div>
                <h2 class=3D"title">
                  <a id=3D"aspell" name=3D"aspell"></a>Aspell-0.60.8.1
                </h2>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class=3D"sect1" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
            <div class=3D"package" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Introduction to Aspell
              </h3>
              <p>
                The <span class=3D"application">Aspell</span> package conta=
ins
                an interactive spell checking program and the <span class=
=3D"application">Aspell</span> libraries. <span class=3D"application">Aspel=
l</span> can either be used as a library
                or as an independent spell checker.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
              </p>
              <h4>
                <a id=3D"idm140470530576528" name=3D"idm140470530576528"></=
a>Package Information
              </h4>
              <div class=3D"itemizedlist">
                <ul class=3D"compact">
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download (HTTP): <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://f=
tp.gnu.org/gnu/aspell/aspell-0.60.8.1.tar.gz">
                      https://ftp.gnu.org/gnu/aspell/aspell-0.60.8.1.tar.gz=
</a>
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download MD5 sum: 187bd142f522ada555c7aa6b9cbf56e6
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download size: 3.4 MB
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Estimated disk space required: 41 MB (Additional 8 MB
                      for EN dictionary)
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Estimated build time: 0.4 SBU
                    </p>
                  </li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <h4>
                <a id=3D"idm140470530569104" name=3D"idm140470530569104"></=
a>Additional Downloads
              </h4>
              <p>
                You'll need to download at least one dictionary. The Englis=
h
                dictionary is given as an example below. Dictionaries in ma=
ny
                other languages can be found at <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"=
https://ftp.gnu.org/gnu/aspell/dict">https://ftp.gnu.org/gnu/aspell/dict</a=
>.
              </p>
              <div class=3D"itemizedlist">
                <ul class=3D"compact">
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Aspell English dictionary: <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D=
"https://ftp.gnu.org/gnu/aspell/dict/en/aspell6-en-2020.12.07-0.tar.bz2">
                      https://ftp.gnu.org/gnu/aspell/dict/en/aspell6-en-202=
0.12.07-0.tar.bz2</a>
                    </p>
                  </li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <h4>
                <a id=3D"idm140470530565216" name=3D"idm140470530565216"></=
a>Aspell Dependencies
              </h4>
              <h5>
                <a id=3D"idm140470530564528" name=3D"idm140470530564528"></=
a>Required
              </h5>
              <p class=3D"required">
                <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/=
blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#which" title=3D"Whi=
ch-2.21 and Alternatives">Which-2.21</a> (for the
                dictionaries)
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class=3D"installation" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Installation of Aspell
              </h3>
              <p>
                Install <span class=3D"application">Aspell</span> by runnin=
g
                the following commands:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">./configure -=
-prefix=3D/usr &amp;&amp;
make</kbd></pre>
              <p>
                This package does not come with a test suite.
              </p>
              <p>
                Now, as the <code class=3D"systemitem">root</code> user:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"root"><kbd class=3D"command">make install &amp;=
&amp;
ln -svfn aspell-0.60 /usr/lib/aspell &amp;&amp;

install -v -m755 -d /usr/share/doc/aspell-0.60.8.1/aspell{,-dev}.html &amp;=
&amp;

install -v -m644 manual/aspell.html/* \
    /usr/share/doc/aspell-0.60.8.1/aspell.html &amp;&amp;

install -v -m644 manual/aspell-dev.html/* \
    /usr/share/doc/aspell-0.60.8.1/aspell-dev.html</kbd></pre>
              <p>
                If you do not plan to install <span class=3D"application">I=
spell</span>, then copy the wrapper script
                <span class=3D"command"><strong>ispell</strong></span>:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"root"><kbd class=3D"command">install -v -m 755 =
scripts/ispell /usr/bin/</kbd></pre>
              <p>
                If you do not plan to install <span class=3D"application">S=
pell</span>, then copy the wrapper script
                <span class=3D"command"><strong>spell</strong></span>:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"root"><kbd class=3D"command">install -v -m 755 =
scripts/spell /usr/bin/</kbd></pre>
            </div>
            <div class=3D"commands" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Command Explanations
              </h3>
              <p>
                <span class=3D"command"><strong>ln -svfn aspell-0.60
                /usr/lib/aspell</strong></span>: This command is useful for
                configuration of other applications, such as <a class=3D"xr=
ef" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOO=
K-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#enchant" title=3D"enchant-2.8.2">enchant-2.8.2</a=
>.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class=3D"configuration" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Configuring Aspell
              </h3>
              <div class=3D"sect3" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
                <div class=3D"titlepage">
                  <div>
                    <div>
                      <h4 class=3D"title">
                        <a id=3D"idm140470530544912" name=3D"idm14047053054=
4912"></a>Configuration Information
                      </h4>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <p>
                  After <span class=3D"application">Aspell</span> is instal=
led,
                  you must set up at least one dictionary. Install the
                  English dictionary by running the following commands:
                </p>
                <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">tar xf ../a=
spell6-en-2020.12.07-0.tar.bz2 &amp;&amp;
cd aspell6-en-2020.12.07-0                &amp;&amp;

./configure &amp;&amp;
make</kbd></pre>
                <p>
                  Now, as the <code class=3D"systemitem">root</code> user:
                </p>
                <pre class=3D"root"><kbd class=3D"command">make install</kb=
d></pre>
                <p>
                  Other dictionaries can be installed with the same
                  instructions.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class=3D"content" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Contents
              </h3>
              <div class=3D"segmentedlist">
                <div class=3D"seglistitem">
                  <div class=3D"seg">
                    <strong class=3D"segtitle">Installed Programs:</strong>
                    <span class=3D"segbody">aspell, aspell-import, precat,
                    preunzip, prezip, prezip-bin, pspell-config,
                    run-with-aspell, word-list-compress and optionally,
                    ispell and spell.</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class=3D"seg">
                    <strong class=3D"segtitle">Installed Libraries:</strong=
>
                    <span class=3D"segbody">libaspell.so and
                    libpspell.so</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class=3D"seg">
                    <strong class=3D"segtitle">Installed Directories:</stro=
ng>
                    <span class=3D"segbody">/usr/include/pspell and
                    /usr/lib/aspell-0.60</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class=3D"variablelist">
