a
                          test utility to test out <span class=3D"applicati=
on">Aspell</span> features, and as a
                          utility for managing dictionaries
                        </p>
                      </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                      <td>
                        <p>
                          <a id=3D"aspell-ispell" name=3D"aspell-ispell"></=
a><span class=3D"term"><span class=3D"command"><strong>ispell</strong></spa=
n></span>
                        </p>
                      </td>
                      <td>
