              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Introduction to Brotli
              </h3>
              <p>
                <span class=3D"application">Brotli</span> provides a
                general-purpose lossless compression algorithm that
                compresses data using a combination of a modern variant of
                the LZ77 algorithm, Huffman coding and 2nd order context
                modeling. Its libraries are particularly used for WOFF2 fon=
ts
                on webpages.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
              </p>
              <h4>
                <a id=3D"idm140470530395632" name=3D"idm140470530395632"></=
a>Package Information
              </h4>
