              </h3>
              <p>
                Install <span class=3D"application">brotli</span> by runnin=
g
                the following commands:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">mkdir build &=
amp;&amp;
cd    build &amp;&amp;

cmake -D CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=3D/usr \
      -D CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=3DRelease  \
      ..  &amp;&amp;
make</kbd></pre>
              <p>
                To test the results, issue: <span class=3D"command"><strong=
>make test</strong></span>.
              </p>
              <p>
                Now, as the <code class=3D"systemitem">root</code> user:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"root"><kbd class=3D"command">make install</kbd>=
</pre>
              <p>
                If desired, build the <span class=3D"application">Python3</=
span> bindings:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">cd .. &amp;&a=
mp;
sed "/c\/.*\.[ch]'/d;\
     /include_dirs=3D\[/\
     i libraries=3D['brotlicommon','brotlidec','brotlienc']," \
    -i setup.py &amp;&amp;
pip3 wheel -w dist --no-build-isolation --no-deps --no-cache-dir $PWD</kbd>=
</pre>
