mp/test-enchant.txt &lt;&lt; "EOF"
<code class=3D"literal">Tel me more abot linux
Ther ar so many commads</code>
EOF

enchant-2 -d en_GB -l /tmp/test-enchant.txt &amp;&amp;
enchant-2 -d en_GB -a /tmp/test-enchant.txt</kbd></pre>
