                Introduction to keyutils
              </h3>
              <p>
                <span class=3D"application">Keyutils</span> is a set of
                utilities for managing the key retention facility in the
                kernel, which can be used by filesystems, block devices and
                more to gain and retain the authorization and encryption ke=
ys
