            <div class=3D"package" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Introduction to libblockdev
              </h3>
              <p>
                libblockdev is a C library supporting GObject Introspection
                for manipulation of block devices. It has a plugin-based
                architecture where each technology (like LVM, Btrfs, MD RAI=
D,
                Swap,...) is implemented in a separate plugin, possibly wit=
h
                multiple implementations (e.g. using LVM CLI or the new LVM
                DBus API).
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
              </p>
