he
                --enable-64bit parameter is <span class=3D"emphasis"><em>re=
quired</em></span> on an x86_64 system to
                prevent <span class=3D"command"><strong>configure</strong><=
/span> failing with a
                claim that this is a system without pthread support. The [
                $(uname -m) =3D x86_64 ] test ensures it has no effect on a=
 32
                bit system.
