s
                <span class=3D"command"><strong>cmake</strong></span> remov=
e
                hardcoded library search paths (rpath) when installing a
                binary executable file or a shared library. This package do=
es
                not need rpath once it's installed into the standard
                location, and rpath may sometimes cause unwanted effects or
                even security issues.
              </p>
              <p>
                <span class=3D"command"><strong>sed 's/utf8_range//' -i
                *.pc</strong></span>: This command removes a leftover
                reference to libutf8_range from the pkg-config files
                installed by this package.
              </p>
              <p>
                <em class=3D"parameter"><code>-D
                protobuf_BUILD_TESTS=3DOFF</code></em>: This parameter prev=
ents
                the tests from being built because <a class=3D"ulink" href=
=3D"https://github.com/google/googletest">gtest</a> is not part
                of BLFS.
