                protobuf_BUILD_SHARED_LIBS=3DON</code></em>: This parameter
                enables building shared versions of the libraries provided =
by
                this package instead of static versions.
              </p>
              <p>
                <em class=3D"parameter"><code>-D
                utf8_range_ENABLE_INSTALL=3DOFF</code></em>: This parameter
                disables installing the utf8_range static library. The
                functions provided by this library and used by protobuf is
                already embedded into <code class=3D"filename">libprotobuf.=
so</code>, so installing a full copy
                of the static library is just wasting the disk space.
              </p>
