romscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#xorg=
7-font" title=3D"Xorg Fonts">Xorg Fonts</a> (runtime), <a class=3D"xref" hr=
ef=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2=
-sysv-nochunks.html#slang" title=3D"slang-2.3.3">slang-2.3.3</a>, and <a cl=
ass=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable=
/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#gpm" title=3D"GPM-1.20.7">GPM-1.20.7</a>
              </p>
