                <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/=
blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#freetype2" title=3D=
"FreeType-2.13.3">FreeType-2.13.3</a>
              </p>
              <h5>
                <a id=3D"idm140470525115952" name=3D"idm140470525115952"></=
a>Optional
              </h5>
              <p class=3D"optional">
                <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/=
blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#bubblewrap" title=
=3D"Bubblewrap-0.9.0">bubblewrap-0.9.0</a> (used by some tests),
                <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/=
blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#curl" title=3D"cURL=
-8.9.1">cURL-8.9.1</a> and <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfroms=
cratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#unzip" t=
itle=3D"UnZip-6.0">UnZip-6.0</a> (both used by some tests for
