ref=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.=
2-sysv-nochunks.html#json-c" title=3D"JSON-C-0.17">JSON-C-0.17</a>, <a clas=
s=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/B=
LFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#docbook-utils" title=3D"DocBook-utils-0.6.=
14">DocBook-utils-0.6.14</a> and <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linu=
xfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#li=
bxml2" title=3D"libxml2-2.13.3">libxml2-2.13.3</a>, <a class=3D"xref" href=
=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-s=
ysv-nochunks.html#texlive" title=3D"texlive-20240312-source">texlive-202403=
12</a> (or <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/=
downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#tl-installer" title=3D"i=
nstall-tl-unx">install-tl-unx</a>)
              </p>
              <div class=3D"admon note">
                <h3>
                  Note
                </h3>
                <p>
                  An Internet connection is needed for some tests of this
                  package.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div class=3D"admon note">
                <h3>
                  Note
                </h3>
                <p>
                  If you have <span class=3D"application">DocBook Utils</sp=
an>
                  installed and you remove the <em class=3D"parameter"><cod=
e>--disable-docs</code></em> parameter from
                  the <span class=3D"command"><strong>configure</strong></s=
pan>
                  command below, you must have <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"ht=
tps://www.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-no=
chunks.html#perl-sgmlspm" title=3D"SGMLSpm-1.1">SGMLSpm-1.1</a> and
                  <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.or=
g/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#texlive" title=3D=
"texlive-20240312-source">texlive-20240312</a> installed
                  also, or the <span class=3D"application">Fontconfig</span=
>
