                Introduction to JasPer
              </h3>
              <p>
                The <span class=3D"application">JasPer</span> Project is an
                open-source initiative to provide a free software-based
                reference implementation of the JPEG-2000 codec.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
              </p>
              <h4>
