                Installation of JasPer
              </h3>
              <div class=3D"admon note">
                <h3>
                  Note
                </h3>
                <p>
                  The tarball <span class=3D"emphasis"><em>jasper-4.2.4.tar=
.gz</em></span> will extract
                  to <span class=3D"emphasis"><em>jasper-version-4.2.4</em>=
</span>.
                </p>
              </div>
              <p>
                Install <span class=3D"application">JasPer</span> by runnin=
g
                the following commands:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">mkdir BUILD &=
amp;&amp;
cd    BUILD &amp;&amp;

cmake -D CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=3D/usr    \
      -D CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=3DRelease     \
      -D CMAKE_SKIP_INSTALL_RPATH=3DON  \
      -D JAS_ENABLE_DOC=3DNO            \
      -D ALLOW_IN_SOURCE_BUILD=3DYES    \
      -D CMAKE_INSTALL_DOCDIR=3D/usr/share/doc/jasper-4.2.4 \
      ..  &amp;&amp;
make</kbd></pre>
              <p>
                To test the results, issue: <span class=3D"command"><strong=
>make test</strong></span>.
              </p>
              <p>
                Now, as the <code class=3D"systemitem">root</code> user:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"root"><kbd class=3D"command">make install</kbd>=
</pre>
