s
                switch if you have not installed <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D=
"https://chromium.googlesource.com/libyuv/libyuv/">libyuv</a>.
              </p>
              <p>
                <code class=3D"option">-D AVIF_CODEC_DAV1D=3DSYSTEM</code>:=
 Use
                this switch if you have installed <a class=3D"ulink" href=
=3D"https://code.videolan.org/videolan/dav1d">libdav1d</a> and
                wish to use it as a codec.
              </p>
              <p>
                <code class=3D"option">-D AVIF_CODEC_RAV1E=3DSYSTEM</code>:=
 Use
                this switch if you have installed <a class=3D"ulink" href=
=3D"https://github.com/xiph/rav1e">rav1e</a> and wish to use it
                as a codec.
              </p>
              <p>
                <code class=3D"option">-D AVIF_CODEC_SVT=3DSYSTEM</code>: U=
se
                this switch if you have installed <a class=3D"ulink" href=
=3D"https://gitlab.com/AOMediaCodec/SVT-AV1">svt-av1</a> and
                wish to use it as a codec.
              </p>
