nks.html#sqlite" title=3D"SQLite-3.46.1">SQLite-3.46.1</a> as the database,
                instead of Berkeley DB.
              </p>
              <p>
                <code class=3D"option">--with-database=3D{lmdb,qdbm,tokyoca=
binet}</code>:
                This switch also allows to use lmdb, qdbm, or tokyocabinet =
as
                the database.
              </p>
