blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#qt5-components" tit=
le=3D"qt5-components-5.15.14">qt5-components-5.15.14</a> (for
                building the <span class=3D"command"><strong>gvedit</strong=
></span> graph editor)
              </p>
