ocbook-xml-4.5">docbook-xml-4.5</a>, <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.=
linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.htm=
l#docbook-xsl" title=3D"docbook-xsl-nons-1.79.2">docbook-xsl-nons-1.79.2</a=
>,
                <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/=
blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#glib2" title=3D"GLi=
b-2.80.4">GLib-2.80.4</a>, <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfroms=
cratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#itstool"=
 title=3D"itstool-2.0.7">itstool-2.0.7</a>, <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https=
