              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Installation of GTK-Doc
              </h3>
              <p>
                Install <span class=3D"application">GTK-Doc</span> by runni=
ng
                the following commands:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">mkdir -p buil=
d &amp;&amp;
cd       build &amp;&amp;

meson setup --prefix=3D/usr --buildtype=3Drelease .. &amp;&amp;
ninja</kbd></pre>
              <p>
                The test suite will hang if the package (or a previous
                version) is not already installed.
              </p>
              <p>
                Now, as the <code class=3D"systemitem">root</code> user:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"root"><kbd class=3D"command">ninja install</kbd=
></pre>
              <p>
                To test the results, issue: <span class=3D"command"><strong=
>ninja test</strong></span>. Some tests will
                fail depending on optionally installed packages.
              </p>
            </div>
