                <a id=3D"idm140470522260768" name=3D"idm140470522260768"></=
a>Optional
              </h5>
              <p class=3D"optional">
                <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/=
blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#qt6" title=3D"Qt-6.=
7.2">Qt-6.7.2</a> (to
                build the GUI front-end)
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class=3D"installation" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Installation of Highlight
              </h3>
              <p>
                For consistency, do not compress man pages.
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">sed -i '/GZIP=
/s/^/#/' makefile</kbd></pre>
              <p>
                To build <span class=3D"application">Highlight</span> run t=
he
                following command:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">make</kbd></p=
re>
              <p>
                To build the <span class=3D"application">qt6</span> GUI
                front-end, run the following command:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">make doc_dir=
=3D/usr/share/doc/highlight-4.13/ gui</kbd></pre>
              <p>
                This package does not come with a test suite.
              </p>
              <p>
                To install <span class=3D"application">Highlight</span>, ru=
n
                the following command as the <code class=3D"systemitem">roo=
t</code> user:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"root"><kbd class=3D"command">make doc_dir=3D/us=
r/share/doc/highlight-4.13/ install</kbd></pre>
