          <div class=3D"sect1" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
            <div class=3D"package" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Introduction to ibus
              </h3>
              <p>
                <span class=3D"application">ibus</span> is an Intelligent I=
nput
                Bus. It is a new input framework for the Linux OS. It
                provides a fully featured and user friendly input method us=
er
                interface.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
              </p>
              <h4>
