                    <p>
                      Download (HTTP): <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://g=
ithub.com/ibus/ibus/archive/1.5.30/ibus-1.5.30.tar.gz">
                      https://github.com/ibus/ibus/archive/1.5.30/ibus-1.5.=
30.tar.gz</a>
