.html#libxkbcommon" title=3D"libxkbcommon-1.7.0">libxkbcommon-1.7.0</a>, <a=
 class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/sta=
ble/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#wayland" title=3D"Wayland-1.23.0">Way=
land-1.23.0</a> (both to build the
