              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Introduction to AccountsService
              </h3>
              <p>
                The <span class=3D"application">AccountsService</span> pack=
age
                provides a set of <span class=3D"application">D-Bus</span>
                interfaces for querying and manipulating user account
                information and an implementation of those interfaces based
                on the <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://man.archlinux.org=
/man/usermod.8">usermod(8)</a>,
                <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://man.archlinux.org/man/us=
eradd.8">useradd(8)</a>, and
                <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://man.archlinux.org/man/us=
erdel.8">userdel(8)</a>
                commands.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
              </p>
