                  <tbody>
                    <tr>
                      <td>
                        <p>
                          <a id=3D"acpid-prog" name=3D"acpid-prog"></a><spa=
n class=3D"term"><span class=3D"command"><strong>acpid</strong></span></spa=
n>
                        </p>
                      </td>
                      <td>
                        <p>
                          is a program that listens for ACPI events and
