                        </p>
                      </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                      <td>
                        <p>
                          <a id=3D"acpi_listen" name=3D"acpi_listen"></a><s=
pan class=3D"term"><span class=3D"command"><strong>acpi_listen</strong></sp=
an></span>
                        </p>
                      </td>
                      <td>
                        <p>
                          is a simple tool which connects to <span class=3D=
"command"><strong>acpid</strong></span> and listens
