                        </p>
                      </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                      <td>
                        <p>
                          <a id=3D"kacpimon" name=3D"kacpimon"></a><span cl=
ass=3D"term"><span class=3D"command"><strong>kacpimon</strong></span></span=
>
                        </p>
                      </td>
                      <td>
                        <p>
                          is a monitor program that connects to three sourc=
es
