          <div class=3D"sect1" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
            <div class=3D"package" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Introduction to Autofs
              </h3>
              <p>
                <span class=3D"application">Autofs</span> controls the
                operation of the automount daemons. The automount daemons
                automatically mount filesystems when they are accessed and
                unmount them after a period of inactivity. This is done bas=
ed
                on a set of pre-configured maps.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
              </p>
              <h4>
