g>bluetoothd</strong></span> daemon when
                  the system is rebooted, install the <code class=3D"filena=
me">/etc/rc.d/init.d/bluetooth</code> bootscript
                  from the <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfroms=
cratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#bootscri=
pts" title=3D"BLFS Boot Scripts">blfs-bootscripts-20240416</a> package.
                </p>
                <pre class=3D"root"><kbd class=3D"command">make install-blu=
etooth</kbd></pre>
