&amp;
install -v -m755 -d /usr/share/doc/cpio-2.15/html &amp;&amp;
install -v -m644    doc/html/* \
                    /usr/share/doc/cpio-2.15/html &amp;&amp;
install -v -m644    doc/cpio.{html,txt} \
                    /usr/share/doc/cpio-2.15</kbd></pre>
              <p>
                If you built PDF or Postscript documentation, install it by
                issuing the following commands as the <code class=3D"system=
item">root</code> user:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"root"><kbd class=3D"command">install -v -m644 d=
oc/cpio.{pdf,ps,dvi} \
                 /usr/share/doc/cpio-2.15</kbd></pre>
