nch</strong></span> program)
              </p>
              <h5>
                <a id=3D"idm140470520417328" name=3D"idm140470520417328"></=
a>Optional
              </h5>
              <p class=3D"optional">
                For the tests: <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxf=
romscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#dbus=
-python" title=3D"D-Bus Python-1.3.2">D-Bus Python-1.3.2</a>, <a class=3D"x=
ref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BO=
OK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#pygobject3" title=3D"PyGObject-3.48.2">PyGObject=
-3.48.2</a>, and <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org=
/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#valgrind" title=3D=
"Valgrind-3.23.0">Valgrind-3.23.0</a>;
                for documentation: <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.li=
nuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#=
doxygen" title=3D"Doxygen-1.12.0">Doxygen-1.12.0</a>, <a class=3D"xref" hre=
f=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-=
sysv-nochunks.html#xmlto" title=3D"xmlto-0.0.29">xmlto-0.0.29</a>, <a class=
=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://pypi.python.org/pypi/mallard-ducktype">Ducktype<=
/a>,
                and <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://download.gnome.org/s=
ources/yelp-tools/">Yelp
