                        <p>
                          is used to send a message to a <span class=3D"app=
lication">D-Bus</span> message bus
                        </p>
                      </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                      <td>
                        <p>
                          <a id=3D"dbus-test-tool" name=3D"dbus-test-tool">=
</a><span class=3D"term"><span class=3D"command"><strong>dbus-test-tool</st=
rong></span></span>
                        </p>
                      </td>
                      <td>
                        <p>
                          is a <span class=3D"application">D-Bus</span> tra=
ffic
                          generator and test tool; it is a multi-purpose to=
ol
