ation">D-Bus</span>
                        </p>
                      </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                      <td>
                        <p>
                          <a id=3D"dbus-update-activation-environment" name=
=3D"dbus-update-activation-environment"></a><span class=3D"term"><span clas=
s=3D"command"><strong>dbus-update-activation-environment</strong></span></s=
pan>
                        </p>
                      </td>
                      <td>
                        <p>
                          is used to update the environment used for
                          <span class=3D"application">D-Bus</span> session
                          services; it updates the list of environment
                          variables used by <span class=3D"command"><strong=
>dbus-daemon
                          --session</strong></span> when it activates sessi=
on
                          services without using systemd
                        </p>
                      </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                      <td>
                        <p>
                          <a id=3D"dbus-uuidgen" name=3D"dbus-uuidgen"></a>=
<span class=3D"term"><span class=3D"command"><strong>dbus-uuidgen</strong><=
/span></span>
                        </p>
                      </td>
                      <td>
                        <p>
                          is used to generate a universally unique ID
                        </p>
                      </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                      <td>
                        <p>
                          <a id=3D"libdbus-1" name=3D"libdbus-1"></a><span =
class=3D"term"><code class=3D"filename">libdbus-1.so</code></span>
                        </p>
                      </td>
                      <td>
                        <p>
                          contains the API functions used by the <span clas=
s=3D"application">D-Bus</span> message daemon.
                          <span class=3D"application">D-Bus</span> is first=
 a
                          library that provides one-to-one communication
                          between any two applications; <span class=3D"comm=
and"><strong>dbus-daemon</strong></span> is an
                          application that uses this library to implement a
                          message bus daemon
                        </p>
                      </td>
                    </tr>
                  </tbody>
                </table>
