          <div class=3D"titlepage">
            <div>
              <div>
                <h2 class=3D"title">
                  <a id=3D"elogind" name=3D"elogind"></a>elogind-255.5
                </h2>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class=3D"sect1" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
            <div class=3D"package" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Introduction to elogind
              </h3>
              <p>
                <span class=3D"application">elogind</span> is the <span cla=
ss=3D"application">systemd</span> project's "logind", extracted to
                be a standalone daemon. It integrates with <a class=3D"xref=
" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-=
12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#linux-pam" title=3D"Linux-PAM-1.6.1">Linux-PAM-1.6.=
1</a>
                to track all the users logged in to a system, and whether
                they are logged in graphically, on the console, or remotely=
.
                <span class=3D"application">Elogind</span> exposes this
                information via the standard org.freedesktop.login1
                <span class=3D"application">D-Bus</span> interface, and als=
o
                through the file system using systemd's standard <code clas=
s=3D"filename">/run/systemd</code> layout.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
              </p>
              <h4>
                <a id=3D"idm140470520239040" name=3D"idm140470520239040"></=
a>Package Information
              </h4>
              <div class=3D"itemizedlist">
                <ul class=3D"compact">
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download (HTTP): <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://g=
ithub.com/elogind/elogind/archive/v255.5/elogind-255.5.tar.gz">
                      https://github.com/elogind/elogind/archive/v255.5/elo=
gind-255.5.tar.gz</a>
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download MD5 sum: 8653d1959c25b649c398a932ce56b396
                    </p>
                  </li>
