              </p>
              <h5>
                <a id=3D"idm140470520224944" name=3D"idm140470520224944"></=
a>Optional
              </h5>
              <p class=3D"optional">
                <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/=
blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#lxml" title=3D"lxml=
-5.3.0">lxml-5.3.0</a>, <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscra=
tch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#zsh" title=
