              <p class=3D"usernotes">
                Editor Notes: <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://wiki.linux=
fromscratch.org/blfs/wiki/Logind">https://wiki.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/wi=
ki/Logind</a>
