                        </p>
                      </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                      <td>
                        <p>
                          <a id=3D"elogind-inhibit" name=3D"elogind-inhibit=
"></a><span class=3D"term"><span class=3D"command"><strong>elogind-inhibit<=
/strong></span></span>
                        </p>
                      </td>
                      <td>
                        <p>
                          is used to execute a program with a shutdown, sle=
ep
                          or idle inhibitor lock taken
                        </p>
                      </td>
