                    <tr>
                      <td>
                        <p>
                          <a id=3D"loginctl" name=3D"loginctl"></a><span cl=
ass=3D"term"><span class=3D"command"><strong>loginctl</strong></span></span=
>
                        </p>
                      </td>
                      <td>
                        <p>
                          is used to introspect and control the state of th=
e
