          <div class=3D"titlepage">
            <div>
              <div>
                <h2 class=3D"title">
                  <a id=3D"blocaled" name=3D"blocaled"></a>blocaled-0.6
                </h2>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class=3D"sect1" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
            <div class=3D"package" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Introduction to blocaled
              </h3>
              <p>
                <span class=3D"application">blocaled</span> is an
                implementation of the <span class=3D"emphasis"><em>org.free=
desktop.locale1</em></span> D-Bus
                protocol, which normally comes with <span class=3D"applicat=
ion">systemd</span>. It is needed by the
                <span class=3D"application">GNOME</span> desktop.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
              </p>
              <h4>
                <a id=3D"idm140470520121296" name=3D"idm140470520121296"></=
a>Package Information
              </h4>
              <div class=3D"itemizedlist">
                <ul class=3D"compact">
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download (HTTP): <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://g=
ithub.com/lfs-book/blocaled/releases/download/v0.6/blocaled-0.6.tar.xz">
                      https://github.com/lfs-book/blocaled/releases/downloa=
d/v0.6/blocaled-0.6.tar.xz</a>
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download MD5 sum: b85e436aee3612879b9948a0cc96ce00
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download size: 160 KB
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
