              <div>
                <h2 class=3D"title">
                  <a id=3D"mc" name=3D"mc"></a>MC-4.8.32
                </h2>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class=3D"sect1" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
            <div class=3D"package" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Introduction to MC
              </h3>
              <p>
                <span class=3D"application">MC</span> (Midnight Commander) =
is a
                text-mode full-screen file manager and visual shell. It
                provides a clear, user-friendly, and somewhat protected
                interface to a Unix system while making many frequent file
                operations more efficient and preserving the full power of
                the command prompt.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
              </p>
              <h4>
                <a id=3D"idm140470519490144" name=3D"idm140470519490144"></=
a>Package Information
              </h4>
              <div class=3D"itemizedlist">
                <ul class=3D"compact">
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download (HTTP): <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"http://ft=
p.midnight-commander.org/mc-4.8.32.tar.xz">http://ftp.midnight-commander.or=
g/mc-4.8.32.tar.xz</a>
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download MD5 sum: bcc9043a815c02c5837f8b1a4a60da5a
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
