e
                following commands:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">./configure -=
-prefix=3D/usr \
            --sysconfdir=3D/etc \
            --enable-charset &amp;&amp;
make</kbd></pre>
              <p>
