              </p>
              <pre class=3D"root"><kbd class=3D"command">make install</kbd>=
</pre>
            </div>
            <div class=3D"commands" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Command Explanations
              </h3>
              <p>
                <em class=3D"parameter"><code>--sysconfdir=3D/etc</code></e=
m>:
                This switch places the global configuration directory in
                <code class=3D"filename">/etc</code>.
              </p>
              <p>
                <em class=3D"parameter"><code>--enable-charset</code></em>:
                This switch adds support to <span class=3D"command"><strong=
>mcedit</strong></span> for editing files in
                encodings different from the one implied by the current
                locale.
              </p>
              <p>
                <em class=3D"parameter"><code>--with-screen=3Dncurses</code=
></em>: Use this
                if you don't have <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.lin=
uxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#s=
lang" title=3D"slang-2.3.3">slang-2.3.3</a> installed.
              </p>
              <p>
