                  <tbody>
                    <tr>
                      <td>
                        <p>
                          <a id=3D"on_ac_power" name=3D"on_ac_power"></a><s=
pan class=3D"term"><span class=3D"command"><strong>on_ac_power</strong></sp=
an></span>
                        </p>
                      </td>
                      <td>
                        <p>
                          is a script that determines whether the system is
