                  <a id=3D"idm140470519004256" name=3D"idm140470519004256">=
</a>Short Descriptions
                </h4>
                <table border=3D"0" class=3D"variablelist">
                  <colgroup>
                    <col align=3D"left" valign=3D"top">
                    <col>
                  </colgroup>
                  <tbody>
                    <tr>
                      <td>
                        <p>
                          <a id=3D"powerprofilesctl" name=3D"powerprofilesc=
tl"></a><span class=3D"term"><span class=3D"command"><strong>powerprofilesc=
tl</strong></span></span>
                        </p>
                      </td>
                      <td>
                        <p>
                          This allows the user to set the power governor of
