          <div class=3D"titlepage">
            <div>
              <div>
                <h2 class=3D"title">
                  <a id=3D"raptor" name=3D"raptor"></a>Raptor-2.0.16
                </h2>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class=3D"sect1" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
            <div class=3D"package" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Introduction to Raptor
              </h3>
              <p>
                <span class=3D"application">Raptor</span> is a C library th=
at
                provides a set of parsers and serializers that generate
                Resource Description Framework (RDF) triples.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
              </p>
              <h4>
                <a id=3D"idm140470518992032" name=3D"idm140470518992032"></=
a>Package Information
              </h4>
              <div class=3D"itemizedlist">
                <ul class=3D"compact">
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
