              </h3>
              <p>
                Install <span class=3D"application">sysmon-qt</span> by run=
ning
                the following commands:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">cd src       =
        &amp;&amp;
qmake6 sysmon-qt.pro &amp;&amp;
make</kbd></pre>
