            <div class=3D"installation" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Installation of UDisks
              </h3>
              <p>
                Install <span class=3D"application">UDisks</span> by runnin=
g
                the following commands:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">./configure -=
-prefix=3D/usr        \
            --sysconfdir=3D/etc    \
            --localstatedir=3D/var \
            --disable-static     \
            --enable-available-modules &amp;&amp;
make</kbd></pre>
              <p>
                To test the results, issue: <span class=3D"command"><strong=
>make check</strong></span>. A more thorough
                test can be run with <span class=3D"command"><strong>make
                ci</strong></span>. You must first create the directories
                <code class=3D"filename">/var/run/udisks2</code> and
                <code class=3D"filename">/var/lib/udisks2</code>, and the
                optional python modules should be present.
              </p>
              <p>
                Now, as the <code class=3D"systemitem">root</code> user:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"root"><kbd class=3D"command">make install</kbd>=
</pre>
            </div>
