                <em class=3D"parameter"><code>--disable-static</code></em>:
                This switch prevents installation of static versions of the
                libraries.
              </p>
              <p>
                <code class=3D"option">--enable-gtk-doc</code>: Use this
                parameter if <span class=3D"application">GTK-Doc</span> is
                installed and you wish to rebuild and install the API
                documentation.
              </p>
              <p>
                <em class=3D"parameter"><code>--enable-available-modules</c=
ode></em>:
                This switch enables additional <span class=3D"application">=
UDisks2</span> functionalities if <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.lin=
uxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#l=
ibblockdev" title=3D"libblockdev-3.1.1">libblockdev-3.1.1</a> has been buil=
t with
                optional dependencies.
              </p>
