          </div>
          <div class=3D"sect1" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
            <div class=3D"package" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Introduction to UPower
              </h3>
              <p>
                The <span class=3D"application">UPower</span> package provi=
des
                an interface for enumerating power devices, listening to
                device events and querying history and statistics. Any
                application or service on the system can access the
                org.freedesktop.UPower service via the system message bus.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
