                Command Explanations
              </h3>
              <p>
                <em class=3D"parameter"><code>-D gtk-doc=3Dfalse</code></em=
>:
                Prevents building the documentation. Remove this if you hav=
e
                <span class=3D"application">GTK-Doc</span> installed and wi=
sh
                to build the documentation.
              </p>
              <p>
                <em class=3D"parameter"><code>-D man=3Dfalse</code></em>:
                Prevents building the manual pages. Remove this if you have
                <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/=
blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#libxslt" title=3D"l=
ibxslt-1.1.42">libxslt-1.1.42</a> and <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www=
.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.ht=
ml#docbook-xsl" title=3D"docbook-xsl-nons-1.79.2">docbook-xsl-nons-1.79.2</=
a>
                installed and wish to build the manual pages.
              </p>
              <p>
                <em class=3D"parameter"><code>-D
                systemdsystemunitdir=3Dno</code></em>: Removes the dependen=
cy
                on <span class=3D"application">systemd</span>.
              </p>
              <p>
                <em class=3D"parameter"><code>-D
                udevrulesdir=3D/usr/lib/udev/rules.d</code></em>: Tells the
                build system where to install <span class=3D"application">u=
dev</span> rules because the information is
                missing in <code class=3D"filename">/usr/lib/pkgconfig/libu=
dev.pc</code>
              </p>
            </div>
