                <ul class=3D"compact">
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download (HTTP): <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://f=
tp.gnu.org/gnu/which/which-2.21.tar.gz">https://ftp.gnu.org/gnu/which/which=
-2.21.tar.gz</a>
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download MD5 sum: 097ff1a324ae02e0a3b0369f07a7544a
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download size: 148 KB
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Estimated disk space required: 1 MB
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Estimated build time: less than 0.1 SBU
                    </p>
                  </li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class=3D"installation" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Installation of Which
              </h3>
              <p>
                Install <span class=3D"application">which</span> by running=
 the
                following commands:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">./configure -=
-prefix=3D/usr &amp;&amp;
make</kbd></pre>
              <p>
                This package does not come with a test suite.
              </p>
              <p>
                Now, as the <code class=3D"systemitem">root</code> user:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"root"><kbd class=3D"command">make install</kbd>=
</pre>
            </div>
            <div class=3D"content" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Contents
              </h3>
              <div class=3D"segmentedlist">
                <div class=3D"seglistitem">
                  <div class=3D"seg">
                    <strong class=3D"segtitle">Installed Program:</strong>
                    <span class=3D"segbody">which</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class=3D"seg">
