s=3D"quote">=E2=80=9C<span class=3D"quote">legacy</span>=E2=80=9D</span> pa=
ckage
                where some grammar constructs are invalid in ISO 9899:1999
                and newer standards.
              </p>
              <p>
                <em class=3D"parameter"><code>prefix=3D/usr</code></em>: Th=
is
                parameter overrides the <code class=3D"varname">prefix</cod=
e>
                variable that is set to <code class=3D"filename">/usr/local=
</code> in the <code class=3D"filename">unix/Makefile</code> file.
