              <div>
                <h2 class=3D"title">
                  <a id=3D"doxygen" name=3D"doxygen"></a>Doxygen-1.12.0
                </h2>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class=3D"sect1" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
            <div class=3D"package" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Introduction to Doxygen
              </h3>
              <p>
                The <span class=3D"application">Doxygen</span> package cont=
ains
                a documentation system for C++, C, Java, Objective-C, Corba
                IDL and to some extent PHP, C# and D. It is useful for
                generating HTML documentation and/or an off-line reference
                manual from a set of documented source files. There is also
                support for generating output in RTF, PostScript, hyperlink=
ed
                PDF, compressed HTML, and Unix man pages. The documentation
                is extracted directly from the sources, which makes it much
                easier to keep the documentation consistent with the source
                code.
              </p>
              <p>
                You can also configure <span class=3D"application">Doxygen<=
/span> to extract the code structure
                from undocumented source files. This is very useful to
                quickly find your way in large source distributions. Used
                along with <span class=3D"application">Graphviz</span>, you=
 can
                also visualize the relations between the various elements b=
y
                means of include dependency graphs, inheritance diagrams, a=
nd
                collaboration diagrams, which are all generated
                automatically.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
              </p>
              <h4>
                <a id=3D"idm140470517681680" name=3D"idm140470517681680"></=
a>Package Information
              </h4>
              <div class=3D"itemizedlist">
                <ul class=3D"compact">
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download (HTTP): <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://d=
oxygen.nl/files/doxygen-1.12.0.src.tar.gz">https://doxygen.nl/files/doxygen=
-1.12.0.src.tar.gz</a>
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
