              <h5>
                <a id=3D"idm140470517201920" name=3D"idm140470517201920"></=
a>Optional (to create the man pages,
                html docs and other docs)
              </h5>
              <p class=3D"optional">
                <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/=
blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#xmlto" title=3D"xml=
to-0.0.29">xmlto-0.0.29</a> and <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linux=
fromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#asc=
