              </h3>
              <p>
                The <span class=3D"application">Guile</span> package contai=
ns
                the GNU Project's extension language library. <span class=
=3D"application">Guile</span> also contains a stand alone
                <span class=3D"application">Scheme</span> interpreter.
              </p>
