a>Additional Downloads
              </h4>
              <div class=3D"itemizedlist">
                <ul class=3D"compact">
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Required patch: <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://ww=
w.linuxfromscratch.org/patches/blfs/12.2/lua-5.2.4-shared_library-1.patch">
                      https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/patches/blfs/12.2/lu=
a-5.2.4-shared_library-1.patch</a>
                    </p>
                  </li>
