1
                </h2>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class=3D"sect1" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
            <div class=3D"package" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Introduction to Mercurial
              </h3>
              <p>
                <span class=3D"application">Mercurial</span> is a distribut=
ed
                source control management tool similar to <span class=3D"ap=
plication">Git</span> and <span class=3D"application">Bazaar</span>. <span =
class=3D"application">Mercurial</span> is written in <span class=3D"applica=
tion">Python</span> and is used by projects such as
                Mozilla for Firefox and Thunderbird.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
              </p>
              <h4>
                <a id=3D"idm140470516224784" name=3D"idm140470516224784"></=
a>Package Information
              </h4>
              <div class=3D"itemizedlist">
                <ul class=3D"compact">
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download (HTTP): <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://w=
ww.mercurial-scm.org/release/mercurial-6.8.1.tar.gz">
                      https://www.mercurial-scm.org/release/mercurial-6.8.1=
.tar.gz</a>
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download MD5 sum: f0c076d22c07bf65ffb02753fc516084
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download size: 7.9 MB
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Estimated disk space required: 113 MB (with docs, add
                      1.5 GB for tests)
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Estimated build time: 0.3 SBU (with docs; add 16 SBU
                      for tests; both using parallelism=3D8)
                    </p>
                  </li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <h4>
                <a id=3D"idm140470516217280" name=3D"idm140470516217280"></=
a>Mercurial Dependencies
              </h4>
              <h5>
                <a id=3D"idm140470516216592" name=3D"idm140470516216592"></=
a>Optional
              </h5>
              <p class=3D"optional">
                <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/=
blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#docutils" title=3D"=
docutils-0.21.2">docutils-0.21.2</a> (required to build the
                documentation), <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linux=
fromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#git=
" title=3D"Git-2.46.0">git-2.46.0</a>, <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://ww=
w.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.h=
tml#gpgme" title=3D"GPGME-1.23.2">GPGME-1.23.2</a> (with Python bindings),
