          <div class=3D"sect1" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
            <div class=3D"package" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Introduction to Python 3
              </h3>
              <p>
                The <span class=3D"application">Python 3</span> package
                contains the <span class=3D"application">Python</span>
                development environment. This is useful for object-oriented
                programming, writing scripts, prototyping large programs or
                developing entire applications.
              </p>
              <div class=3D"admon note">
                <h3>
                  Note
                </h3>
                <p>
                  <span class=3D"application">Python 3</span> was installed=
 in
                  LFS. The only reason to rebuild it here is if optional
                  modules are needed, or to upgrade this package.
                </p>
              </div>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
              </p>
              <div class=3D"admon important">
                <h3>
                  Important
                </h3>
                <p>
                  If upgrading to a new Python-3 minor version (for example=
,
                  from Python-3.11.x to Python-3.12.0), you will need to
                  reinstall any Python3 modules you have installed. You
                  should also reinstall packages that generate Python3
                  modules including <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.l=
inuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html=
#glib2" title=3D"GLib-2.80.4">GLib-2.80.4</a> (with GObject Introspection),
                  <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.or=
g/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#libxml2" title=3D=
"libxml2-2.13.3">libxml2-2.13.3</a>, <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.=
linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.htm=
l#opencv" title=3D"opencv-4.10.0">opencv-4.10.0</a>,
                  <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.or=
g/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#fontforge" title=
=3D"FontForge-20230101">FontForge-20230101</a>, <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"h=
ttps://www.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-n=
ochunks.html#gnome-tweaks" title=3D"gnome-tweaks-46.1">gnome-tweaks-46.1</a=
>, <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/download=
s/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#samba" title=3D"Samba-4.20.4">Sa=
mba-4.20.4</a>, and
                  <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.or=
g/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#graphviz" title=
=3D"Graphviz-12.1.0">Graphviz-12.1.0</a> (if swig is
                  installed).
                </p>
                <p>
                  Before you upgrade, you can get a list of modules install=
ed
                  with <span class=3D"command"><strong>pip3
                  list</strong></span>. The list may be incomplete as some
                  Python modules are not installed with <span class=3D"comm=
and"><strong>pip3</strong></span>, for example the
                  <code class=3D"literal">cracklib</code> module installed =
by
                  <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.or=
g/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#cracklib" title=
=3D"CrackLib-2.10.2">CrackLib-2.10.2</a>. Use <span class=3D"command"><stro=
ng>ls /usr/lib/python3.<em class=3D"replaceable"><code>minor</code></em>/si=
te-packages</strong></span>
                  for a comprehensive list.
                </p>
                <p>
                  The Python modules from LFS will also have to be
                  reinstalled: <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://www.linux=
fromscratch.org/lfs/view/12.2/chapter08/flit-core.html">flit-core</a>,
                  <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.o=
rg/lfs/view/12.2/chapter08/wheel.html">wheel</a>,
                  <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.o=
rg/lfs/view/12.2/chapter08/setuptools.html">setuptools</a>,
                  <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.o=
rg/lfs/view/12.2/chapter08/meson.html">meson</a>,
                  <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.o=
rg/lfs/view/12.2/chapter08/markupsafe.html">MarkupSafe</a>,
                  and <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscrat=
ch.org/lfs/view/12.2/chapter08/jinja2.html">Jinja2</a>.
                </p>
