                  deprecated in favor of <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https:/=
/pypi.org/project/myst-parser/">MyST-Parser</a>.
                  For this reason, a lot of tests have to be disabled becau=
se
                  they do not pass with recent versions of <span class=3D"a=
pplication">Sphinx</span>. The installation can be
                  partially tested with the following command:
                </p>
                <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">pytest -k '=
not (test_integration or test_code or test_headings or test_image or test_l=
inks or test_lists)'</kbd></pre>
