                  <ul class=3D"compact">
                    <li class=3D"listitem">
                      <p>
                        Download (HTTP): <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https:/=
/files.pythonhosted.org/packages/source/r/requests/requests-2.32.3.tar.gz">
