                      <h4 class=3D"title">
                        <a id=3D"idm140470511282272" name=3D"idm14047051128=
2272"></a>Installation of Requests
                      </h4>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <p>
                  First apply a patch so that the same environment variable
                  already used to point to system certificates in
                  <span class=3D"application">Python3</span> following the
                  installation of <span class=3D"application">make-ca</span=
>
                  can also be used by this module:
                </p>
                <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">patch -Np1 =
-i ../requests-2.32.3-use_system_certs-1.patch</kbd></pre>
                <p>
                  Build the module:
                </p>
                <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">pip3 wheel =
-w dist --no-build-isolation --no-deps --no-cache-dir $PWD</kbd></pre>
                <p>
                  Now, as the <code class=3D"systemitem">root</code> user:
                </p>
                <pre class=3D"root"><kbd class=3D"command">pip3 install --n=
o-index --find-links=3Ddist --no-cache-dir --no-user requests</kbd></pre>
                <p>
                  Assuming <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfroms=
cratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#pytest" =
title=3D"Pytest-8.3.2">pytest-8.3.2</a> is installed, but the other
                  optional dependencies are not, the installation can be
                  tested with the following commands:
                </p>
                <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">python3 -m =
venv --system-site-packages testenv &amp;&amp;
source testenv/bin/activate                    &amp;&amp;
pip3 install --force-reinstall sphinx\&lt;5       &amp;&amp;
pip3 install pytest-mock    \
             werkzeug\&lt;2    \
             flask\&lt;2       \
             pytest-httpbin \
             pysocks        \
             trustme                           &amp;&amp;
pip3 install --force-reinstall Markupsafe\&lt;2.1 &amp;&amp;
python3 /usr/bin/pytest tests
deactivate</kbd></pre>
                <div class=3D"admon note">
                  <h3>
                    Note
                  </h3>
                  <p>
                    See <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscra=
tch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#make-ca" ti=
tle=3D"make-ca-1.14">make-ca-1.14</a> for how to set the
                    environment variable, and for how local copies of the
                    Certifi and Requests modules installed in a virtual
                    environment <span class=3D"emphasis"><em>will</em></spa=
n>
                    override the system certificates.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
