                  </div>
                </div>
                <p>
                  The <span class=3D"application">Alabaster</span> package =
is a
                  theme for the <span class=3D"application">sphinx</span>
                  documentation system. Although developed separately, it i=
s
                  the default theme for sphinx.
                </p>
