                /usr/bin/wish</strong></span>: This command is used to crea=
te
                a compatibility symbolic link to the <span class=3D"command=
"><strong>wish8.6</strong></span> file as many
                packages expect a file named <span class=3D"command"><stron=
g>wish</strong></span>.
              </p>
              <p>
