                tkConfig.sh</strong></span>: The <span class=3D"application=
">Tk</span> package expects that its source tree
                is preserved so that packages depending on it for their
                compilation can utilize it. This <span class=3D"command"><s=
trong>sed</strong></span> removes the references
                to the build directory and replaces them with saner
                system-wide locations.
              </p>
