              </p>
              <p>
                <code class=3D"option">--enable-lto=3Dyes</code>: This opti=
on
                allows building Valgrind with LTO (link time optimization).
                This produces a smaller/faster Valgrind (up to 10%), but
                build time increases to about 5.5 SBU.
              </p>
