          <div class=3D"sect1" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
            <div class=3D"package" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Introduction to Net-tools
              </h3>
              <p>
                The <span class=3D"application">Net-tools</span> package is=
 a
                collection of programs for controlling the network subsyste=
m
                of the Linux kernel.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
              </p>
              <h4>
