              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Introduction to NetworkManager
              </h3>
              <p>
                <span class=3D"application">NetworkManager</span> is a set =
of
                co-operative tools that make networking simple and
                straightforward. Whether you use WiFi, wired, 3G, or
                Bluetooth, NetworkManager allows you to quickly move from o=
ne
                network to another: Once a network has been configured and
                joined once, it can be detected and re-joined automatically
                the next time it's available.
              </p>
