                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download (HTTP): <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://d=
ownload.gnome.org/sources/network-manager-applet/1.34/network-manager-apple=
t-1.34.0.tar.xz">
                      https://download.gnome.org/sources/network-manager-ap=
plet/1.34/network-manager-applet-1.34.0.tar.xz</a>
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download MD5 sum: 83ff059aff3a691766d5f0079209e5af
                    </p>
                  </li>
