                  Note
                </h3>
                <p>
                  This package overwrites the version of <span class=3D"com=
mand"><strong>traceroute</strong></span> that was
                  installed in the inetutils package in LFS. This version i=
s
                  more powerful and allows many more options than the
                  standard version.
