              <p>
                Install <span class=3D"application">Traceroute</span> by
                running the following commands:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">make</kbd></p=
re>
              <p>
                This package does not come with a test suite.
              </p>
              <p>
                Now, as the <code class=3D"systemitem">root</code> user:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"root"><kbd class=3D"command">make prefix=3D/usr=
 install                                 &amp;&amp;
ln -sv -f traceroute /usr/bin/traceroute6                &amp;&amp;
ln -sv -f traceroute.8 /usr/share/man/man8/traceroute6.8 &amp;&amp;
rm -fv /usr/share/man/man1/traceroute.1</kbd></pre>
              <p>
                The traceroute.1 file that was installed in LFS by inetutil=
s
                is no longer relevant. This package overwrites that version
                of traceroute and installs the man page in man chapter 8.
