            <div class=3D"package" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Introduction to Mutt
              </h3>
              <p>
                The <span class=3D"application">Mutt</span> package contain=
s a
                Mail User Agent. This is useful for reading, writing,
                replying to, saving, and deleting your email.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
              </p>
