          <div class=3D"titlepage">
            <div>
              <div>
                <h2 class=3D"title">
                  <a id=3D"kea" name=3D"kea"></a>Kea 2.6.1 DHCP Server
                </h2>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class=3D"sect1" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
            <div class=3D"package" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Introduction to ISC Kea DHCP Server
              </h3>
              <p>
                The <span class=3D"application">ISC Kea</span> package cont=
ains
                the server programs for DHCP. It is the successor of the ol=
d
                ISC DHCP server which is end-of-life since December 2022.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
              </p>
              <h4>
                <a id=3D"idm140470502853600" name=3D"idm140470502853600"></=
a>Package Information
              </h4>
              <div class=3D"itemizedlist">
                <ul class=3D"compact">
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download (HTTP): <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://d=
ownloads.isc.org/isc/kea/2.6.1/kea-2.6.1.tar.gz">
                      https://downloads.isc.org/isc/kea/2.6.1/kea-2.6.1.tar=
.gz</a>
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download MD5 sum: 5f4fe79ed29f5ff2802e2961d1827b25
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
