bnsl-2.0.1">libnsl-2.0.1</a>, <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfr=
omscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#perl-=
file-fcntllock" title=3D"File::FcntlLock-0.22">File-FcntlLock-0.22</a> and =
<a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/s=
table/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#pcre2" title=3D"PCRE2-10.44">pcre2-=
10.44</a>
              </p>
              <h5>
                <a id=3D"idm140470502411168" name=3D"idm140470502411168"></=
a>Optional
              </h5>
              <p class=3D"optional">
                <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://sourceforge.net/projects=
/tdb">TDB</a> (alternative
                to GDBM, built in LFS), <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://w=
ww.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.=
html#cyrus-sasl" title=3D"Cyrus SASL-2.1.28">Cyrus SASL-2.1.28</a>, <a clas=
s=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/B=
LFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#libidn" title=3D"libidn-1.42">libidn-1.42<=
