OpenLDAP-2.6.8">OpenLDAP-2.6.8</a>, <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.l=
inuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html=
#gnutls" title=3D"GnuTLS-3.8.7.1">GnuTLS-3.8.7.1</a>,
