                <p>
                  The installed size of MariaDB is 725 MB, but this can be
                  reduced by about 265 MB, if desired, by removing the
                  <code class=3D"filename">/usr/share/mysql/test</code>
                  directory after installation.
                </p>
              </div>
              <h4>
                <a id=3D"idm140470501705008" name=3D"idm140470501705008"></=
