          <div class=3D"sect1" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
            <div class=3D"package" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Introduction to PostgreSQL
              </h3>
              <p>
                <span class=3D"application">PostgreSQL</span> is an advance=
d
                object-relational database management system (ORDBMS),
                derived from the Berkeley Postgres database management
                system.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
              </p>
              <h4>
                <a id=3D"idm140470501341744" name=3D"idm140470501341744"></=
