            <div>
              <div>
                <h2 class=3D"title">
                  <a id=3D"sqlite" name=3D"sqlite"></a>SQLite-3.46.1
                </h2>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class=3D"sect1" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
            <div class=3D"package" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Introduction to SQLite
              </h3>
              <p>
                The <span class=3D"application">SQLite</span> package is a
                software library that implements a self-contained,
                serverless, zero-configuration, transactional SQL database
                engine.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
              </p>
              <h4>
                <a id=3D"idm140470501004528" name=3D"idm140470501004528"></=
a>Package Information
              </h4>
              <div class=3D"itemizedlist">
                <ul class=3D"compact">
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download (HTTP): <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://s=
qlite.org/2024/sqlite-autoconf-3460100.tar.gz">
                      https://sqlite.org/2024/sqlite-autoconf-3460100.tar.g=
z</a>
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download MD5 sum: bde7df8c2a4bce82dbf42f7e4dda0e21
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
