            <div class=3D"installation" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Installation of SQLite
              </h3>
              <p>
                If you downloaded the optional documentation, issue the
                following command to install the documentation into the
                source tree:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">unzip -q ../s=
qlite-doc-3460100.zip</kbd></pre>
              <p>
                Install <span class=3D"application">SQLite</span> by runnin=
g
                the following commands:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">./configure -=
-prefix=3D/usr     \
            --disable-static  \
            --enable-fts{4,5} \
            CPPFLAGS=3D"-D SQLITE_ENABLE_COLUMN_METADATA=3D1 \
                      -D SQLITE_ENABLE_UNLOCK_NOTIFY=3D1   \
                      -D SQLITE_ENABLE_DBSTAT_VTAB=3D1     \
                      -D SQLITE_SECURE_DELETE=3D1"         &amp;&amp;
make</kbd></pre>
              <p>
                This package does not come with a test suite.
              </p>
              <p>
                Now, as the <code class=3D"systemitem">root</code> user:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"root"><kbd class=3D"command">make install</kbd>=
</pre>
              <p>
                If you downloaded the optional documentation, issue the
                following commands as the <code class=3D"systemitem">root</=
code> user to install it:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"root"><kbd class=3D"command">install -v -m755 -=
d /usr/share/doc/sqlite-3.46.1 &amp;&amp;
cp -v -R sqlite-doc-3460100/* /usr/share/doc/sqlite-3.46.1</kbd></pre>
            </div>
            <div class=3D"commands" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Command Explanations
              </h3>
              <p>
                <em class=3D"parameter"><code>--disable-static</code></em>:
                This switch prevents installation of static versions of the
                libraries.
              </p>
              <p>
                <em class=3D"parameter"><code>--enable-fts{4,5}</code></em>=
:
                These switches enable support for version 3, 4 and 5 of the
                full text search (FTS) extension. Note that the <code class=
=3D"option">--enable-fts4</code> switch enables support for both
                FTS version 4 and FTS version 3.
              </p>
              <p>
                <em class=3D"parameter"><code>CPPFLAGS=3D"-D
                SQLITE_ENABLE_COLUMN_METADATA=3D1 ...</code></em> : Some
                applications require these options to be turned on. The onl=
y
                way to do this is to include them in the <code class=3D"env=
ar">CFLAGS</code> or <code class=3D"envar">CPPFLAGS</code>.
                We use the latter so the default value (or any value set by
                the user) of <code class=3D"envar">CFLAGS</code> won't be
                affected. For further information on what can be specified
                see <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://www.sqlite.org/compi=
le.html">https://www.sqlite.org/compile.html</a>.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class=3D"content" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Contents
              </h3>
              <div class=3D"segmentedlist">
                <div class=3D"seglistitem">
                  <div class=3D"seg">
