                      <td>
                        <p>
                          <a id=3D"sqlite3" name=3D"sqlite3"></a><span clas=
s=3D"term"><span class=3D"command"><strong>sqlite3</strong></span></span>
                        </p>
                      </td>
                      <td>
                        <p>
                          is a terminal-based front-end to the <span class=
=3D"application">SQLite</span> library that can
