                package if <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfroms=
cratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#xmlto" t=
itle=3D"xmlto-0.0.29">xmlto-0.0.29</a> is installed without a text
                browser. Omit this parameter (or the entire <span class=3D"=
command"><strong>case</strong></span> statement) if a text
                browser is installed.
              </p>
              <p>
                <code class=3D"option">--with-fop</code>: Use <a class=3D"x=
ref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BO=
OK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#fop" title=3D"fop-2.9">fop-2.9</a> to generate P=
DF
                documentation (only for the libXfont package).
