              <div>
                <h2 class=3D"title">
                  <a id=3D"libxcvt" name=3D"libxcvt"></a>libxcvt-0.1.2
                </h2>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class=3D"sect1" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
            <div class=3D"package" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Introduction to libxcvt
              </h3>
              <p>
                <span class=3D"application">libxcvt</span> is a library
                providing a standalone version of the X server implementati=
