                The <span class=3D"application">Xorg</span> font packages
                provide some scalable fonts and supporting packages for
                <span class=3D"application">Xorg</span> applications. Many
                people will want to install other TTF or OTF fonts in
                addition to, or instead of, these. Some are listed at
                <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/=
blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#TTF-and-OTF-fonts" =
title=3D"TTF and OTF fonts">the section called =E2=80=9CTTF and OTF
                fonts=E2=80=9D</a>.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
              </p>
              <h4>
                <a id=3D"idm140470499222896" name=3D"idm140470499222896"></=
a>Package Information
              </h4>
              <div class=3D"itemizedlist">
                <ul class=3D"compact">
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download (HTTP): <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://w=
ww.x.org/pub/individual/font/">https://www.x.org/pub/individual/font/</a>
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download size: 3.0 MB
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Estimated disk space required: 8.8 MB
                    </p>
                  </li>
