1792"></a>Introduction to libevdev
                      </h4>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <p>
                  The <span class=3D"application">libevdev</span> package
                  contains common functions for Xorg input drivers.
                </p>
                <p>
                  This package is known to build and work properly using an
                  LFS 12.2 platform.
                </p>
