              </h3>
              <div class=3D"package" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
                <div class=3D"titlepage">
                  <div>
                    <div>
                      <h4 class=3D"title">
                        <a id=3D"idm140470498800736" name=3D"idm14047049880=
0736"></a>Introduction to Libinput
                      </h4>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <p>
                  <span class=3D"application">libinput</span> is a library =
that
                  handles input devices for display servers and other
                  applications that need to directly deal with input device=
s.
                </p>
                <p>
                  This package is known to build and work properly using an
                  LFS 12.2 platform.
                </p>
                <h5>
                  <a id=3D"idm140470498798032" name=3D"idm140470498798032">=
</a>Package Information
                </h5>
