=3D"Valgrind-3.23.0">Valgrind-3.23.0</a> (to run the tests),
                  <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.or=
g/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#gtk3" title=3D"GT=
K+-3.24.43">GTK+-3.24.43</a> (to build the GUI event
