s.html#sphinx" title=3D"Sphinx-8.0.2">sphinx-8.0.2</a>
                  (required to build documentation), and <a class=3D"xref" =
href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12=
.2-sysv-nochunks.html#pyparsing" title=3D"pyparsing-3.1.2">pyparsing-3.1.2<=
/a> (for one non-root
