"></a>Xorg Libinput Driver-1.4.0
              </h3>
              <div class=3D"package" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
                <div class=3D"titlepage">
                  <div>
                    <div>
                      <h4 class=3D"title">
                        <a id=3D"idm140470498714112" name=3D"idm14047049871=
4112"></a>Introduction to Xorg
                        Libinput Driver
                      </h4>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <p>
                  The <span class=3D"application">X.Org Libinput Driver</sp=
an>
                  is a thin wrapper around libinput and allows for libinput
                  to be used for input devices in X. This driver can be use=
d
                  as drop-in replacement for evdev and synaptics.
                </p>
                <p>
                  This package is known to build and work properly using an
                  LFS 12.2 platform.
                </p>
