t support (USB)             [HID_WACOM]
    <span class=3D"blue">U</span>SB HID support ---&gt;
      &lt;*/M&gt; <span class=3D"blue">U</span>SB HID transport layer      =
                              [USB_HID]
  [*] <span class=3D"blue">U</span>SB support ---&gt;                      =
                       [USB_SUPPORT]
    &lt;*/M&gt; <span class=3D"blue">S</span>upport for Host-side USB      =
                                  [USB]</pre>
