XORG_PREFIX/bin/Xorg</kbd></pre>
                <p>
                  At this point you can start Xorg on virtual terminal 7 wi=
th
                  <span class=3D"command"><strong>startx &lt;client
                  arguments&gt; -- vt7</strong></span>. Now you can toggle
                  between tty1 and tty7 with the Ctrl-Alt-F1 and Ctrl-Alt-F=
7
                  key combinations.
                </p>
                <p>
