        <div class=3D"titlepage">
          <div>
            <div>
              <h2 class=3D"title">
                <a id=3D"x-lib" name=3D"x-lib"></a>Chapter&nbsp;25.&nbsp;Gr=
aphical Environment
                Libraries
              </h2>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class=3D"chapter" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
          <p>
            This chapter does not contain libraries that are required to ru=
n
            <span class=3D"application">X</span>. It does contain libraries
            that enhance <span class=3D"application">X</span>. In some case=
s
            the enhancement is as simple as font support. In others it is a=
s
            complex as libraries that sit between <span class=3D"applicatio=
n">X</span> and applications that run on <span class=3D"application">X</spa=
n> whose purpose is to standardize the look
            and feel and inter-process communications for different
            applications. They also assist programmers by supplying common
            elements.
          </p>
          <div class=3D"titlepage">
            <div>
              <div>
                <h2 class=3D"title">
                  <a id=3D"atkmm" name=3D"atkmm"></a>Atkmm-2.28.4
                </h2>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class=3D"sect1" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
            <div class=3D"package" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Introduction to Atkmm
              </h3>
              <p>
                <span class=3D"application">Atkmm</span> is the official C+=
+
                interface for the ATK accessibility toolkit library.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
              </p>
              <h4>
                <a id=3D"idm140470497737088" name=3D"idm140470497737088"></=
a>Package Information
              </h4>
              <div class=3D"itemizedlist">
                <ul class=3D"compact">
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download (HTTP): <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://d=
ownload.gnome.org/sources/atkmm/2.28/atkmm-2.28.4.tar.xz">
                      https://download.gnome.org/sources/atkmm/2.28/atkmm-2=
.28.4.tar.xz</a>
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download MD5 sum: e0f7271990c89a6c9987f215ba47bfc5
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download size: 724 KB
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Estimated disk space required: 14 MB
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Estimated build time: 0.2 SBU
                    </p>
                  </li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <h4>
                <a id=3D"idm140470497729680" name=3D"idm140470497729680"></=
a>Atkmm Dependencies
              </h4>
              <h5>
                <a id=3D"idm140470497728992" name=3D"idm140470497728992"></=
a>Required
              </h5>
              <p class=3D"required">
                <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/=
blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#at-spi2-core" title=
=3D"at-spi2-core-2.52.0">at-spi2-core-2.52.0</a> and <a class=3D"xref" href=
=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-s=
ysv-nochunks.html#glibmm" title=3D"GLibmm-2.66.7">GLibmm-2.66.7</a>
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class=3D"installation" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Installation of Atkmm
              </h3>
              <p>
                Install <span class=3D"application">Atkmm</span> by running=
 the
                following commands:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">mkdir build &=
amp;&amp;
cd    build &amp;&amp;

meson setup --prefix=3D/usr --buildtype=3Drelease .. &amp;&amp;
ninja</kbd></pre>
              <p>
                This package does not come with a test suite.
              </p>
              <p>
                Now, as the <code class=3D"systemitem">root</code> user:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"root"><kbd class=3D"command">ninja install</kbd=
></pre>
            </div>
            <div class=3D"content" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Contents
              </h3>
              <div class=3D"segmentedlist">
                <div class=3D"seglistitem">
                  <div class=3D"seg">
                    <strong class=3D"segtitle">Installed Programs:</strong>
                    <span class=3D"segbody">None</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class=3D"seg">
                    <strong class=3D"segtitle">Installed Library:</strong>
                    <span class=3D"segbody">libatkmm-1.6.so</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class=3D"seg">
                    <strong class=3D"segtitle">Installed Directories:</stro=
ng>
                    <span class=3D"segbody">/usr/{include,lib}/atkmm-1.6 an=
d
                    /usr/share/{devhelp/books/atkmm-1.6,doc/atkmm-2.28.4}</=
span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
