                switch if you don't have <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://=
www.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks=
.html#vala" title=3D"Vala-0.56.17">Vala-0.56.17</a> installed.
              </p>
              <p>
