              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Introduction to FLTK
              </h3>
              <p>
                FLTK (pronounced "fulltick") is a cross-platform C++ GUI
                toolkit. FLTK provides modern GUI functionality and support=
s
                3D graphics via OpenGL and its built-in GLUT emulation
                libraries used for creating graphical user interfaces for
                applications.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
