                Introduction to Freeglut
              </h3>
              <p>
                <span class=3D"application">Freeglut</span> is intended to =
be a
                100% compatible, completely opensourced clone of the GLUT
                library. GLUT is a window system independent toolkit for
                writing OpenGL programs, implementing a simple windowing AP=
I,
                which makes learning about and exploring OpenGL programming
                very easy.
              </p>
