s a
                toolkit for image loading and pixel buffer manipulation. It
                is used by <span class=3D"application">GTK+ 3</span> to loa=
d
                and manipulate images. In the past it was distributed as pa=
rt
                of <span class=3D"application">GTK+ 2</span>, but it was sp=
