scratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#gi-docg=
en" title=3D"Gi-DocGen-2024.1">Gi-DocGen-2024.1</a> installed and wish to
                build the API documentation for this package, issue:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">sed "/docs_di=
r =3D/s@\$@ / 'gdk-pixbuf-2.42.12'@" -i ../docs/meson.build &amp;&amp;
meson configure -D gtk_doc=3Dtrue                                        &a=
mp;&amp;
ninja</kbd></pre>
              <p>
                To test the results, issue: <span class=3D"command"><strong=
>ninja test</strong></span>. The tests make
                a heavy use of disk.
              </p>
              <p>
                Now, as the <code class=3D"systemitem">root</code> user:
              </p>
