          <div class=3D"sect1" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
            <div class=3D"package" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Introduction to Gtkmm
              </h3>
              <p>
                The <span class=3D"application">Gtkmm</span> package provid=
es a
                C++ interface to <span class=3D"application">GTK+ 3</span>.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
              </p>
              <h4>
                <a id=3D"idm140470496557040" name=3D"idm140470496557040"></=
a>Package Information
              </h4>
              <div class=3D"itemizedlist">
                <ul class=3D"compact">
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download (HTTP): <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://d=
ownload.gnome.org/sources/gtkmm/3.24/gtkmm-3.24.9.tar.xz">
                      https://download.gnome.org/sources/gtkmm/3.24/gtkmm-3=
.24.9.tar.xz</a>
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download MD5 sum: 47871a7973e186c1189b2145b507de15
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download size: 14 MB
                    </p>
                  </li>
