              <div>
                <h2 class=3D"title">
                  <a id=3D"xdg-desktop-portal" name=3D"xdg-desktop-portal">=
</a>xdg-desktop-portal-1.18.2
                </h2>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class=3D"sect1" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
            <div class=3D"package" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Introduction to xdg-desktop-portal
              </h3>
              <p>
                <span class=3D"application">xdg-desktop-portal</span> is a
                D-Bus service that allows applications to interact with the
                desktop in a safe way. Several aspects of desktop
                interaction, like file chooser, desktop style, etc are
                implemented in different D-Bus APIs, known as <span class=
=3D"emphasis"><em>portals</em></span>. Sandboxed applications
                benefit the most from this service since they don't need
                special permissions to use the portal APIs, but any
                application can use it. <span class=3D"application">xdg-des=
ktop-portal</span> safeguards many
                resources and features with a user-controlled permission
                system. This service needs a backend implementing
                desktop-specific portal interfaces.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
              </p>
              <h4>
                <a id=3D"idm140470494436944" name=3D"idm140470494436944"></=
a>Package Information
              </h4>
