                      Download (HTTP): <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://g=
ithub.com/flatpak/xdg-desktop-portal/releases/download/1.18.2/xdg-desktop-p=
ortal-1.18.2.tar.xz">
                      https://github.com/flatpak/xdg-desktop-portal/release=
s/download/1.18.2/xdg-desktop-portal-1.18.2.tar.xz</a>
