              <div>
                <h2 class=3D"title">
                  <a id=3D"icewm" name=3D"icewm"></a>IceWM-3.6.0
                </h2>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class=3D"sect1" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
            <div class=3D"package" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Introduction to IceWM
              </h3>
              <p>
                <span class=3D"application">IceWM</span> is a window manage=
r
                with the goals of speed, simplicity, and not getting in the
                user's way.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
              </p>
              <h4>
                <a id=3D"idm140470493839520" name=3D"idm140470493839520"></=
a>Package Information
              </h4>
              <div class=3D"itemizedlist">
                <ul class=3D"compact">
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download (HTTP): <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://g=
ithub.com/ice-wm/icewm/archive/3.6.0/icewm-3.6.0.tar.gz">
                      https://github.com/ice-wm/icewm/archive/3.6.0/icewm-3=
.6.0.tar.gz</a>
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download MD5 sum: a94dde82caae27f01d57fba7ba12225a
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download size: 2.4 MB
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Estimated disk space required: 47 MB
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
