                <a id=3D"idm140470493832112" name=3D"idm140470493832112"></=
a>IceWM Dependencies
              </h4>
              <h5>
                <a id=3D"idm140470493831424" name=3D"idm140470493831424"></=
a>Required
              </h5>
              <p class=3D"required">
                <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/=
blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#cmake" title=3D"CMa=
ke-3.30.2">CMake-3.30.2</a>, <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfro=
mscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#imlib2=
