linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.htm=
l#fribidi" title=3D"FriBidi-1.0.15">FriBidi-1.0.15</a> (for languages writt=
en
                right to left), <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linux=
