                    Download (HTTP): <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://dow=
nload.kde.org/stable/frameworks/6.5">https://download.kde.org/stable/framew=
orks/6.5</a>
                  </p>
                </li>
                <li class=3D"listitem">
                  <p>
                    Download MD5 sum: See Below
                  </p>
                </li>
                <li class=3D"listitem">
