nload.kde.org/stable/plasma/6.1.4">https://download.kde.org/stable/plasma/6=
.1.4</a>
                  </p>
                </li>
                <li class=3D"listitem">
                  <p>
                    Download MD5 sum: See Below
                  </p>
                </li>
                <li class=3D"listitem">
                  <p>
