                Introduction to Evolution Data Server
              </h3>
              <p>
                The <span class=3D"application">Evolution Data Server</span=
>
                package provides a unified backend for programs that work
                with contacts, tasks, and calendar information. It was
                originally developed for <span class=3D"application">Evolut=
ion</span> (hence the name), but is now
                used by other packages as well.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
