            <div class=3D"installation" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Installation of Evolution Data Server
              </h3>
              <p>
                Install <span class=3D"application">Evolution Data
                Server</span> by running the following commands:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">mkdir build &=
amp;&amp;
cd    build &amp;&amp;

cmake -D CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=3D/usr    \
      -D SYSCONF_INSTALL_DIR=3D/etc     \
      -D ENABLE_VALA_BINDINGS=3DON      \
      -D ENABLE_INSTALLED_TESTS=3DON    \
      -D WITH_OPENLDAP=3DOFF            \
      -D WITH_KRB5=3DOFF                \
      -D ENABLE_INTROSPECTION=3DON      \
      -D ENABLE_GTK_DOC=3DOFF           \
      -D WITH_LIBDB=3DOFF               \
      -D WITH_SYSTEMDUSERUNITDIR=3Dno   \
      -W no-dev -G Ninja ..           &amp;&amp;
ninja</kbd></pre>
              <p>
                Now, as the <code class=3D"systemitem">root</code> user:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"root"><kbd class=3D"command">ninja install</kbd=
></pre>
              <p>
                To test the results, issue: <span class=3D"command"><strong=
>ninja test</strong></span>.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class=3D"commands" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Command Explanations
              </h3>
              <p>
                <em class=3D"parameter"><code>-D
                ENABLE_VALA_BINDINGS=3DON</code></em>: This switch enables
                building the Vala bindings. Remove it if you don't have
                <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/=
blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#vala" title=3D"Vala=
-0.56.17">Vala-0.56.17</a> installed.
              </p>
              <p>
                <em class=3D"parameter"><code>-D
                ENABLE_GTK_DOC=3DOFF</code></em>: This switch disables buil=
ding
                the API documentation. It is broken for this package due to
                the use of a long deprecated gtk-doc program that is no
                longer available.
              </p>
              <p>
                <em class=3D"parameter"><code>-D WITH_LIBDB=3DOFF</code></e=
m>:
                This switch allows building this package without <a class=
=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://anduin.linuxfromscratch.org/BLFS/bdb/db-5.3.28.t=
ar.gz">
                Berkeley DB</a> (deprecated). <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"htt=
ps://www.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-noc=
hunks.html#sqlite" title=3D"SQLite-3.46.1">SQLite-3.46.1</a> is used for no=
rmal
                operation.
              </p>
              <p>
                <code class=3D"option">-D ENABLE_OAUTH2_WEBKITGTK4=3DOFF</c=
ode>:
                Use this switch if you did not build <a class=3D"xref" href=
=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-s=
ysv-nochunks.html#webkitgtk" title=3D"WebKitGTK-2.44.3">WebKitGTK-2.44.3</a=
>
                with GTK-4.
              </p>
              <p>
                <em class=3D"parameter"><code>-D
                WITH_SYSTEMDUSERUNITDIR=3Dno</code></em>: This switch disab=
les
                installing the systemd units, which are not used for a Sysv
                build.
              </p>
              <div class=3D"admon note">
                <h3>
                  Note
                </h3>
                <p>
                  To enable many of the optional dependencies, review the
                  information from <span class=3D"command"><strong>cmake -L
                  CMakeLists.txt</strong></span> for the necessary paramete=
rs
                  you must pass to the <span class=3D"command"><strong>cmak=
e</strong></span> command.
                </p>
              </div>
