              </p>
              <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">sed -e 's/lib=
systemd/libelogind/' \
    -i plugins/power/test.py</kbd></pre>
              <p>
                Next, fix backlight functionality in gnome-control-center:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">sed -e 's/(ba=
cklight-&gt;logind_proxy)/(0)/' \
    -i plugins/power/gsd-backlight.c</kbd></pre>
