                Install <span class=3D"application">GNOME Settings
                Daemon</span> by running the following commands:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">mkdir build &=
amp;&amp;
cd    build &amp;&amp;

meson setup --prefix=3D/usr       \
            --buildtype=3Drelease \
            -D systemd=3Dfalse    \
            ..                  &amp;&amp;
ninja</kbd></pre>
              <p>
                To check the results, execute: <span class=3D"command"><str=
ong>ninja test</strong></span>. Note that you
                must have <span class=3D"application">python-dbusmock</span=
>
                installed in order for the tests to complete successfully.
