            <div class=3D"installation" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Installation of GNOME Control Center
              </h3>
              <p>
                Install <span class=3D"application">GNOME Control Center</s=
pan>
                by running the following commands:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">mkdir build &=
amp;&amp;
cd    build &amp;&amp;

meson setup --prefix=3D/usr --buildtype=3Drelease .. &amp;&amp;
ninja</kbd></pre>
              <p>
                To test the results, issue: <span class=3D"command"><strong=
>GTK_A11Y=3Dnone ninja test</strong></span>.
                Note that you must have the <span class=3D"application">pyt=
hon-dbusmock</span> module installed in
                order for the tests to complete successfully.
              </p>
              <p>
                Now, as the <code class=3D"systemitem">root</code> user:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"root"><kbd class=3D"command">ninja install</kbd=
></pre>
            </div>
            <div class=3D"commands" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Command Explanations
              </h3>
