          <div class=3D"sect1" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
            <div class=3D"package" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Introduction to Mutter
              </h3>
              <p>
                <span class=3D"application">Mutter</span> is the window man=
ager
                for <span class=3D"application">GNOME</span>. It is not inv=
oked
                directly, but from <span class=3D"application">GNOME
                Session</span> (on a machine with a hardware accelerated
                video driver).
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
              </p>
              <h4>
                <a id=3D"idm140470489783296" name=3D"idm140470489783296"></=
