href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12=
.2-sysv-nochunks.html#xorg-server" title=3D"Xorg-Server-21.1.13">Xorg-Serve=
r-21.1.13</a> (for X11
