              <p>
                Install <span class=3D"application">GNOME Shell</span> by
                running the following commands:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">mkdir build &=
amp;&amp;
cd    build &amp;&amp;

meson setup --prefix=3D/usr       \
            --buildtype=3Drelease \
            -D systemd=3Dfalse    \
            -D tests=3Dfalse      \
            ..                  &amp;&amp;
ninja</kbd></pre>
              <p>
                To test the results, you need to remove the <em class=3D"pa=
rameter"><code>-D tests=3Dfalse</code></em> switch, and to
                have <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch=
.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#mutter" title=
=3D"Mutter-46.4">Mutter-46.4</a> compiled and installed with
                tests also. To run the tests, issue: <span class=3D"command=
"><strong>ninja test</strong></span>. You must be
                running an X session to run the tests. Some will fail if
                <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/=
blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#gdm" title=3D"GDM-4=
6.2">GDM-46.2</a> is
                not installed. <span class=3D"phrase">Several more tests ma=
y
                fail in the Sysv environment.</span> One test named
                <code class=3D"filename">CSS styling support</code> is know=
n to
                fail with some multi-monitor configurations.
              </p>
              <p>
                Now, as the <code class=3D"systemitem">root</code> user:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"root"><kbd class=3D"command">ninja install</kbd=
></pre>
