              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Introduction to EOG
              </h3>
              <p>
                <span class=3D"application">EOG</span> is an application us=
ed
                for viewing and cataloging image files on the <span class=
=3D"application">GNOME</span> Desktop. It also has basic editing
                capabilities.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
              </p>
              <h4>
