            <div class=3D"installation" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Installation of EOG
              </h3>
              <p>
                Install <span class=3D"application">EOG</span> by running t=
he
                following commands:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">mkdir build &=
amp;&amp;
cd    build &amp;&amp;

meson setup --prefix=3D/usr       \
            --buildtype=3Drelease \
            -D libportal=3Dfalse  \
            ..                  &amp;&amp;
ninja</kbd></pre>
              <p>
                This package does not come with a test suite.
              </p>
              <p>
                Now, as the <code class=3D"systemitem">root</code> user:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"root"><kbd class=3D"command">ninja install</kbd=
></pre>
              <p>
                Still as the <code class=3D"systemitem">root</code> user,
                rebuild the cache database of MIME types handled by desktop
                files so <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscr=
atch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#nautilus" =
title=3D"Nautilus-46.2">Nautilus-46.2</a> will be able to open image
                files with EOG.
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"root"><kbd class=3D"command">update-desktop-dat=
abase</kbd></pre>
            </div>
            <div class=3D"commands" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
