                Command Explanations
              </h3>
              <p>
                <em class=3D"parameter"><code>--buildtype=3Drelease</code><=
/em>:
                Specify a buildtype suitable for stable releases of the
                package, as the default may produce unoptimized binaries.
              </p>
              <p>
                <em class=3D"parameter"><code>-D libportal=3Dfalse</code></=
em>:
                This parameter disables building EOG with support for flatp=
ak
                portals. Remove this parameter if you have <a class=3D"xref=
" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-=
12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#libportal" title=3D"libportal-0.7.1">libportal-0.7.=
1</a>
                installed and wish to have support for flatpak portals.
              </p>
              <p>
                <code class=3D"option">-D gtk_doc=3Dtrue</code>: Use this o=
ption
                if <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.o=
rg/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#gtk-doc" title=
=3D"GTK-Doc-1.34.0">GTK-Doc-1.34.0</a> is installed and you wish
                to rebuild and install the API documentation.
              </p>
