          <div class=3D"sect1" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
            <div class=3D"package" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Introduction to Evince
              </h3>
              <p>
                <span class=3D"application">Evince</span> is a document vie=
wer
                for multiple document formats. It supports PDF, Postscript,
                DjVu, TIFF and DVI. It is useful for viewing documents of
                various types using one simple application instead of the
                multiple document viewers that once existed on the
                <span class=3D"application">GNOME</span> Desktop.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
              </p>
              <h4>
                <a id=3D"idm140470489166448" name=3D"idm140470489166448"></=
a>Package Information
