                <span class=3D"application">Gucharmap</span> is a Unicode
                character map and font viewer. It allows you to browse
                through all the available Unicode characters and categories
                for the installed fonts, and to examine their detailed
                properties. It is an easy way to find the character you mig=
ht
                only know by its Unicode name or code point.
              </p>
