                and the zipped Unihan archive can be found.
              </p>
              <p>
                <span class=3D"command"><strong>rm -fv
                /usr/share/glib-2.0/schemas/org.gnome.Charmap.enums.xml</st=
rong></span>:
                Old versions of this package installed an obsolete file tha=
t
                prevents the program from running, as if the main schema ha=
s
                not been installed. Forcibly removing works even if the old
