          <div class=3D"sect1" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
            <div class=3D"package" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Introduction to Xfce4 Session
              </h3>
              <p>
                <span class=3D"application">Xfce4 Session</span> is a sessi=
on
                manager for <span class=3D"application">Xfce</span>. Its ta=
sk
                is to save the state of your desktop (opened applications a=
nd
                their location) and restore it during a next startup. You c=
an
                create several different sessions and choose one of them on
                startup.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
              </p>
              <h4>
                <a id=3D"idm140470487466976" name=3D"idm140470487466976"></=
a>Package Information
              </h4>
              <div class=3D"itemizedlist">
                <ul class=3D"compact">
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
