blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#desktop-file-utils"=
 title=3D"desktop-file-utils-0.27">desktop-file-utils-0.27</a>,
                <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://docs.xfce.org/apps/scree=
nsaver/start">xfce4-screensaver</a>
                or <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.o=
rg/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#xscreensaver" ti=
tle=3D"XScreenSaver-6.09">XScreenSaver-6.09</a>, <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"=
https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-=
nochunks.html#shared-mime-info" title=3D"shared-mime-info-2.4">shared-mime-=
