        <div class=3D"chapter" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
          <p>
            This is a small collection of optional applications that add
            extra capabilities to your <span class=3D"application">Xfce</sp=
an>
            desktop.
          </p>
          <div class=3D"titlepage">
            <div>
              <div>
                <h2 class=3D"title">
                  <a id=3D"parole" name=3D"parole"></a>Parole-4.18.1
                </h2>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class=3D"sect1" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
            <div class=3D"package" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Introduction to Parole
              </h3>
              <p>
                <span class=3D"application">Parole</span> is a DVD/CD/music
                player for <span class=3D"application">Xfce</span> that use=
s
                <span class=3D"application">GStreamer</span>.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
              </p>
              <div class=3D"admon note">
                <h3>
                  Note
                </h3>
                <p>
                  Although this version of parole works with most files, it
                  is unable to play DVDs, reporting an error in the gstream=
er
                  backend.
                </p>
              </div>
              <h4>
                <a id=3D"idm140470487372864" name=3D"idm140470487372864"></=
a>Package Information
              </h4>
              <div class=3D"itemizedlist">
