                      Download (HTTP): <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://a=
rchive.xfce.org/src/apps/parole/4.18/parole-4.18.1.tar.bz2">
                      https://archive.xfce.org/src/apps/parole/4.18/parole-=
4.18.1.tar.bz2</a>
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download MD5 sum: 29a409b4b22c2d91f210679e5708a19d
                    </p>
                  </li>
