              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Installation of Parole
              </h3>
              <p>
                Install <span class=3D"application">Parole</span> by runnin=
g
                the following commands:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">./configure -=
-prefix=3D/usr &amp;&amp;
make</kbd></pre>
              <p>
                This package does not come with a test suite.
              </p>
              <p>
                Now, as the <code class=3D"systemitem">root</code> user:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"root"><kbd class=3D"command">make install</kbd>=
</pre>
            </div>
            <div class=3D"using" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Using Parole
              </h3>
              <p>
                If you have installed Gstreamer Plugins Ugly with support f=
or
                libdvdnav and libdvdread and would like to use Parole to pl=
ay
                a DVD, click Media&gt; Open location and enter dvd:// into
                the box.
              </p>
              <p>
                Similarly, to play a CD, click Media&gt; Open location and
                enter cdda:// into the box.
