b-2.80.4">GLib-2.80.4</a> (with GObject Introspection),
                <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/=
blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#libgcrypt" title=3D=
"libgcrypt-1.11.0">libgcrypt-1.11.0</a>, <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://=
www.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks=
.html#libical" title=3D"libical-3.0.18">libical-3.0.18</a>,
                <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/=
blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#libsoup" title=3D"l=
ibsoup-2.74.3">libsoup-2.74.3</a>, <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.li=
nuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#=
redland" title=3D"Redland-1.0.17">Redland-1.0.17</a>,
