          <div class=3D"titlepage">
            <div>
              <div>
                <h2 class=3D"title">
                  <a id=3D"gnumeric" name=3D"gnumeric"></a>Gnumeric-1.12.57
                </h2>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class=3D"sect1" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
            <div class=3D"package" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Introduction to Gnumeric
              </h3>
              <p>
                The <span class=3D"application">Gnumeric</span> package
                contains a spreadsheet program which is useful for
                mathematical analysis.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
              </p>
              <h4>
                <a id=3D"idm140470485219776" name=3D"idm140470485219776"></=
a>Package Information
              </h4>
              <div class=3D"itemizedlist">
                <ul class=3D"compact">
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download (HTTP): <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://d=
ownload.gnome.org/sources/gnumeric/1.12/gnumeric-1.12.57.tar.xz">
                      https://download.gnome.org/sources/gnumeric/1.12/gnum=
eric-1.12.57.tar.xz</a>
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download MD5 sum: 237ce4f6c43661892e802bf81dbff1b2
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download size: 17 MB
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Estimated disk space required: 244 MB (add 4 MB for
                      tests)
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Estimated build time: 0.8 SBU (add 1.7 SBU for tests;
                      both using parallelism=3D4)
                    </p>
                  </li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <h4>
                <a id=3D"idm140470485212288" name=3D"idm140470485212288"></=
a>Gnumeric Dependencies
              </h4>
              <h5>
                <a id=3D"idm140470485211600" name=3D"idm140470485211600"></=
a>Required
              </h5>
              <p class=3D"required">
                <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/=
blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#goffice010" title=
=3D"GOffice-0.10.57">GOffice-0.10.57</a> and <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"http=
s://www.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-noch=
unks.html#itstool" title=3D"itstool-2.0.7">itstool-2.0.7</a>
              </p>
              <h5>
                <a id=3D"idm140470485208944" name=3D"idm140470485208944"></=
a>Recommended Runtime
              </h5>
              <p class=3D"recommended">
                an icon theme such as <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www=
.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.ht=
ml#adwaita-icon-theme" title=3D"adwaita-icon-theme-46.2">adwaita-icon-theme=
-46.2</a>,
                <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/=
blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#oxygen-icons" title=
=3D"oxygen-icons-6.0.0">oxygen-icons-6.0.0</a>, or <a class=3D"xref" href=
=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-s=
ysv-nochunks.html#gnome-icon-theme" title=3D"gnome-icon-theme-3.12.0">gnome=
-icon-theme-3.12.0</a>,
                <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/=
blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#x-window-system" ti=
tle=3D"Chapter&nbsp;24.&nbsp;Graphical Environments">a graphical
                environment</a>, and <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.=
linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.htm=
l#yelp" title=3D"Yelp-42.2">Yelp-42.2</a> for the built-in help functionali=
ty
              </p>
              <h5>
                <a id=3D"idm140470485202800" name=3D"idm140470485202800"></=
a>Optional
              </h5>
              <p class=3D"optional">
                <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/=
blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#dconf" title=3D"DCo=
nf-0.40.0 / DConf-Editor-45.0.1">DConf-0.40.0</a> (to
                prevent some test failures), <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"http=
s://www.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-noch=
unks.html#glib2" title=3D"GLib-2.80.4">GLib-2.80.4</a> (with GObject
                Introspection), <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linux=
fromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#pyg=
object3" title=3D"PyGObject-3.48.2">PyGObject-3.48.2</a>, <a class=3D"xref"=
 href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-1=
2.2-sysv-nochunks.html#valgrind" title=3D"Valgrind-3.23.0">Valgrind-3.23.0<=
/a>
                (for some tests), <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://dblate=
x.sourceforge.net/">dblatex</a> (for PDF
                docs), <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://www.gnome-db.org/=
">libgda</a>, <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://www.mono-project.com/">Mon=
o</a>, <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://pxlib.sourceforge.net/">pxlib</a>=
, and
                <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://frodo.looijaard.name/pro=
ject/psiconv">Psiconv</a>
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class=3D"installation" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Installation of Gnumeric
              </h3>
              <p>
                Install <span class=3D"application">Gnumeric</span> by runn=
ing
                the following commands:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">./configure -=
-prefix=3D/usr  &amp;&amp;
make</kbd></pre>
              <p>
                This package must be installed before the test suite is run=
.
              </p>
              <p>
                Now, as the <code class=3D"systemitem">root</code> user:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"root"><kbd class=3D"command">make install</kbd>=
</pre>
              <p>
                To run the tests, issue <span class=3D"command"><strong>mak=
e
                check</strong></span>. Tests should be run from an active X
                session, and <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfro=
mscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#dconf"=
 title=3D"DConf-0.40.0 / DConf-Editor-45.0.1">DConf-0.40.0</a> should
                be installed to prevent some failures. Two tests are known =
to
                fail. Additional failures may occur if valgrind is installe=
d.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class=3D"commands" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Command Explanations
              </h3>
              <p>
                <code class=3D"option">--enable-pdfdocs</code>: Use this sw=
itch
                if you have installed dblatex and wish to create PDF docs.
              </p>
            </div>
