          <div class=3D"sect1" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
            <div class=3D"package" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Introduction to LibreOffice
              </h3>
              <p>
                <span class=3D"application">LibreOffice</span> is a
                full-featured office suite. It is largely compatible with
                <span class=3D"application">Microsoft Office</span> and is
                descended from <span class=3D"application">OpenOffice.org</=
span>.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
              </p>
