                Introduction to Firefox
              </h3>
              <p>
                <span class=3D"application">Firefox</span> is a stand-alone
                browser based on the <span class=3D"application">Mozilla</s=
pan>
                codebase.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
              </p>
