rchive.mozilla.org/pub/firefox/releases/128.1.0esr/source/firefox-128.1.0es=
r.source.tar.xz">
                      https://archive.mozilla.org/pub/firefox/releases/128.=
1.0esr/source/firefox-128.1.0esr.source.tar.xz</a>
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download MD5 sum: efbf349f0b7442fc6f2995bef4d32785
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download size: 536 MB
