            <div class=3D"installation" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Installation of Balsa
              </h3>
              <p>
                First, fix build issues when configuring without WebKitGTK,
                or when using WebKitGTK-2.38 or later.
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">patch -Np1 -i=
 ../balsa-2.6.4-upstream_fixes-2.patch</kbd></pre>
              <p>
                Install <span class=3D"application">Balsa</span> by running=
 the
