          <div class=3D"sect1" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
            <div class=3D"package" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Introduction to FontForge
              </h3>
              <p>
                The <span class=3D"application">FontForge</span> package
                contains an outline font editor that lets you create your o=
wn
                postscript, truetype, opentype, cid-keyed, multi-master, cf=
f,
                svg and bitmap (bdf, FON, NFNT) fonts, or edit existing one=
s.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
