          <div class=3D"sect1" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
            <div class=3D"package" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Introduction to FreeRDP
              </h3>
              <p>
                The <span class=3D"application">FreeRDP</span> package cont=
ains
                libraries and utilities for utilizing the Remote Desktop
                Protocol. This includes tools to run an RDP server as well =
as
                connecting to a computer using RDP. This is primarily used
                for connecting to Microsoft Windows computers, but can also
                be used on Linux and macOS.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
              </p>
