              <div class=3D"variablelist">
                <h4>
                  <a id=3D"idm140470484065520" name=3D"idm140470484065520">=
</a>Short Descriptions
                </h4>
                <table border=3D"0" class=3D"variablelist">
                  <colgroup>
                    <col align=3D"left" valign=3D"top">
                    <col>
                  </colgroup>
                  <tbody>
                    <tr>
                      <td>
                        <p>
                          <a id=3D"gimp-2.99" name=3D"gimp-2.99"></a><span =
class=3D"term"><span class=3D"command"><strong>gimp-2.99</strong></span></s=
pan>
                        </p>
                      </td>
                      <td>
                        <p>
                          is the Gnu Image Manipulation Program. It works
                          with a variety of image formats and provides a
                          large selection of tools
                        </p>
                      </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                      <td>
                        <p>
                          <a id=3D"gimp-console-2.99" name=3D"gimp-console-=
2.99"></a><span class=3D"term"><span class=3D"command"><strong>gimp-console=
-2.99</strong></span></span>
                        </p>
                      </td>
                      <td>
                        <p>
                          is a console program that behaves as if The
                          <span class=3D"application">Gimp</span> was calle=
d
                          with the <code class=3D"option">--no-interface</c=
ode>
                          command-line option
                        </p>
                      </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                      <td>
                        <p>
                          <a id=3D"gimptool-2.99" name=3D"gimptool-2.99"></=
a><span class=3D"term"><span class=3D"command"><strong>gimptool-2.99</stron=
g></span></span>
                        </p>
                      </td>
                      <td>
                        <p>
                          is a tool that can build plug-ins or scripts and
                          install them if they are distributed in one sourc=
e
                          file. <span class=3D"command"><strong>gimptool-2.=
99</strong></span> can
                          also be used by programs that need to know what
