            <div class=3D"installation" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Installation of Inkscape
              </h3>
              <p>
                First, fix Inkscape to build with poppler-24.05.0:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">patch -Np1 -i=
 ../inkscape-1.3.2-upstream_fixes-2.patch</kbd></pre>
              <p>
                Next, fix a build failure caused by libxml2-2.12.0:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">sed -i '/uri.=
h/a #include &lt;libxml/xmlmemory.h&gt;' src/object/uri.h</kbd></pre>
              <p>
                Install <span class=3D"application">Inkscape</span> by runn=
ing
                the following commands:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">mkdir build  =
                     &amp;&amp;
cd    build                       &amp;&amp;

cmake -D CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=3D/usr \
      -D CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=3DRelease  \
      ..                          &amp;&amp;
make</kbd></pre>
              <div class=3D"admon note">
                <h3>
                  Note
                </h3>
                <p>
                  This package may occasionally fail when building with
                  multiple processors. See <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https:=
//www.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochun=
ks.html#parallel-builds" title=3D"Using Multiple Processors">Using
                  Multiple Processors</a> for more information.
                </p>
              </div>
              <p>
                This package does not come with a working test suite.
              </p>
              <p>
                Now, as the <code class=3D"systemitem">root</code> user:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"root"><kbd class=3D"command">make install</kbd>=
</pre>
              <div class=3D"admon note">
                <h3>
                  Note
                </h3>
                <p>
                  This package installs icon files into the <code class=3D"=
filename">/usr/share/icons/hicolor</code> hierarchy and
                  desktop files into the <code class=3D"filename">/usr/shar=
e/applications</code> hierarchy. You
                  can improve system performance and memory usage by updati=
ng
                  <code class=3D"filename">/usr/share/icons/hicolor/index.t=
heme</code> and
                  <code class=3D"filename">/usr/share/applications/mimeinfo=
.cache</code>.
                  To perform the update you must have <a class=3D"xref" hre=
f=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-=
sysv-nochunks.html#gtk3" title=3D"GTK+-3.24.43">GTK+-3.24.43</a> installed
                  (for the icon cache) and <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https:=
//www.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochun=
ks.html#desktop-file-utils" title=3D"desktop-file-utils-0.27">desktop-file-=
utils-0.27</a> (for
                  the desktop cache) and issue the following commands as th=
e
                  <code class=3D"systemitem">root</code> user:
                </p>
                <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">gtk-update-=
icon-cache -qtf /usr/share/icons/hicolor &amp;&amp;
update-desktop-database -q</kbd></pre>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class=3D"commands" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Command Explanations
              </h3>
              <p>
                <em class=3D"parameter"><code>-D
                CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=3DRelease</code></em>: This switch is used=
