                Introduction to Thunderbird
              </h3>
              <p>
                <span class=3D"application">Thunderbird</span> is a stand-a=
lone
                mail/news client based on the <span class=3D"application">M=
ozilla</span> codebase. It uses the Gecko
                rendering engine to enable it to display and compose HTML
                emails.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
