 ../transmission-4.0.6-build_fix-1.patch</kbd></pre>
              <p>
                Install <span class=3D"application">Transmission</span> by
                running the following commands:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">mkdir build &=
amp;&amp;
cd    build &amp;&amp;

cmake -D CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=3D/usr \
      -D CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=3DRelease  \
      -D CMAKE_INSTALL_DOCDIR=3D/usr/share/doc/transmission-4.0.6 \
      .. &amp;&amp;

make</kbd></pre>
              <p>
                Now, as the <code class=3D"systemitem">root</code> user:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"root"><kbd class=3D"command">make install</kbd>=
</pre>
              <p>
                Next, create transmission.png from the SVG file:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"root"><kbd class=3D"command">rsvg-convert      =
                                         \
   /usr/share/icons/hicolor/scalable/apps/transmission.svg \
   -o /usr/share/pixmaps/transmission.png</kbd></pre>
