blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#qt6" title=3D"Qt-6.=
7.2">Qt-6.7.2</a> is
                installed.
              </p>
              <p>
                <code class=3D"option">-D ENABLE_GTK=3DOFF</code>: This swi=
tch
                disables building the GTK-4 interface. The default is to
                build it if <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfrom=
scratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#gtkmm4"=
 title=3D"Gtkmm-4.14.0">Gtkmm-4.14.0</a> is installed.
              </p>
              <p>
                <code class=3D"option">-D ENABLE_WEB=3DOFF</code>: This swi=
tch
                disables building the web client. The default is to build i=
t
                if <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.o=
rg/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#nodejs" title=3D=
"Node.js-20.16.0">nodejs-20.16.0</a> is installed.
              </p>
              <p>
                <code class=3D"option">-D REBUILD_WEB=3DON</code>: This swi=
tch
                forces rebuilding the web client. This option needs <a clas=
s=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/B=
LFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#nodejs" title=3D"Node.js-20.16.0">nodejs-2=
0.16.0</a> to be installed as well
                as an internet connection. The default is to not rebuild th=
e
                client.
