              <div class=3D"variablelist">
                <h4>
                  <a id=3D"idm140470482854496" name=3D"idm140470482854496">=
</a>Short Descriptions
                </h4>
                <table border=3D"0" class=3D"variablelist">
                  <colgroup>
                    <col align=3D"left" valign=3D"top">
                    <col>
                  </colgroup>
                  <tbody>
                    <tr>
                      <td>
                        <p>
                          <a id=3D"as10k1" name=3D"as10k1"></a><span class=
=3D"term"><span class=3D"command"><strong>as10k1</strong></span></span>
                        </p>
                      </td>
                      <td>
                        <p>
                          is an assembler for the emu10k1 DSP chip present =
in
                          the Creative SB Live, PCI 512, and emu APS sound
                          cards. It is used to make audio effects such as a
                          flanger, chorus or reverb
                        </p>
                      </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
