          <div class=3D"sect1" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
            <div class=3D"package" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Introduction to GStreamer Base Plug-ins
              </h3>
              <p>
                The <span class=3D"application">GStreamer Base Plug-ins</sp=
an>
                is a well-groomed and well-maintained collection of
                <span class=3D"application">GStreamer</span> plug-ins and
                elements, spanning the range of possible types of elements
                one would want to write for <span class=3D"application">GSt=
reamer</span>. You will need at least one of
                Good, Bad, Ugly or Libav plugins for <span class=3D"applica=
tion">GStreamer</span> applications to function
                properly.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
              </p>
