                package, as the default may produce unoptimized binaries.
              </p>
              <p>
                <em class=3D"parameter"><code>--wrap-mode=3Dnodownload</cod=
e></em>: This
                switch prevents <span class=3D"command"><strong>meson</stro=
ng></span> from downloading any
                optional dependency which is not installed on the system.
              </p>
            </div>
