              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Installation of GStreamer Bad Plug-ins
              </h3>
              <div class=3D"admon note">
                <h3>
                  Note
                </h3>
                <p>
                  If you need a plugin for a given dependency, that
                  dependency needs to be installed before this package.
                </p>
              </div>
              <p>
                Install <span class=3D"application">GStreamer Bad
                Plug-ins</span> by running the following commands:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">mkdir build &=
amp;&amp;
cd    build &amp;&amp;

meson setup ..            \
      --prefix=3D/usr       \
      --buildtype=3Drelease \
      -D gpl=3Denabled      &amp;&amp;
ninja</kbd></pre>
              <p>
                To test the results, issue: <span class=3D"command"><strong=
>ninja test</strong></span>. Several tests
                need a terminal emulator in a graphical session. Two tests,
                <span class=3D"emphasis"><em>elements_vapostproc</em></span=
>
                and <span class=3D"emphasis"><em>elements_dash_mpd</em></sp=
an>,
                are known to fail. If <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www=
.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.ht=
ml#gst10-plugins-good" title=3D"gst-plugins-good-1.24.7">gst-plugins-good-1=
.24.7</a> is not
                installed, two tests, <span class=3D"emphasis"><em>elements=
_rtpsrc</em></span> and <span class=3D"emphasis"><em>elements_rtpsink</em><=
/span>, will fail.
              </p>
              <p>
                Now, as the <code class=3D"systemitem">root</code> user:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"root"><kbd class=3D"command">ninja install</kbd=
></pre>
            </div>
