                Introduction to libmpeg2
              </h3>
              <p>
                The <span class=3D"application">libmpeg2</span> package
                contains a library for decoding MPEG-2 and MPEG-1 video
                streams. The library is able to decode all MPEG streams tha=
t
                conform to certain restrictions: <span class=3D"quote">=E2=
=80=9C<span class=3D"quote">constrained
                parameters</span>=E2=80=9D</span> for MPEG-1, and <span cla=
ss=3D"quote">=E2=80=9C<span class=3D"quote">main profile</span>=E2=80=9D</s=
pan> for
                MPEG-2. This is useful for programs and applications needin=
g
                to decode MPEG-2 and MPEG-1 video streams.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
              </p>
              <h4>
                <a id=3D"idm140470481216272" name=3D"idm140470481216272"></=
