          <div class=3D"sect1" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
            <div class=3D"package" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Introduction to PulseAudio
              </h3>
              <p>
                <span class=3D"application">PulseAudio</span> is a sound sy=
stem
                for POSIX OSes, meaning that it is a proxy for sound
                applications. It allows you to do advanced operations on yo=
ur
                sound data as it passes between your application and your
                hardware. Operations such as transferring the audio to a
                different machine, changing the sample format or channel
                count, and mixing several sounds into one are easily achiev=
ed
                using a sound server.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
              </p>
              <h4>
                <a id=3D"idm140470480402528" name=3D"idm140470480402528"></=
a>Package Information
              </h4>
