          <div class=3D"sect1" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
            <div class=3D"package" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Introduction to SBC
              </h3>
              <p>
                The <span class=3D"application">SBC</span> package is a dig=
ital
                audio encoder and decoder used to transfer data to Bluetoot=
h
                audio output devices like headphones or loudspeakers.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
              </p>
              <h4>
                <a id=3D"idm140470480238512" name=3D"idm140470480238512"></=
a>Package Information
              </h4>
              <div class=3D"itemizedlist">
