ithub.com/libsdl-org/sdl12-compat/archive/release-1.2.68/sdl12-compat-relea=
se-1.2.68.tar.gz">
                      https://github.com/libsdl-org/sdl12-compat/archive/re=
lease-1.2.68/sdl12-compat-release-1.2.68.tar.gz</a>
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
