          <div class=3D"sect1" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
            <div class=3D"package" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Introduction to Wireplumber
              </h3>
              <p>
                The <span class=3D"application">Wireplumber</span> package
                contains a session and policy manager for <span class=3D"ap=
plication">Pipewire</span>.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
              </p>
              <h4>
                <a id=3D"idm140470479772240" name=3D"idm140470479772240"></=
a>Package Information
              </h4>
