            <div class=3D"installation" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Installation of Audacious
              </h3>
              <div class=3D"sect3" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
                <div class=3D"titlepage">
                  <div>
                    <div>
                      <h4 class=3D"title">
                        <a id=3D"idm140470479414848" name=3D"idm14047047941=
4848"></a>Installation of the Main
                        Audacious Program
                      </h4>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <p>
                  Install <span class=3D"application">Audacious</span> by
                  running the following commands (you may wish to change th=
e
                  buildstamp to another string):
                </p>
                <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">mkdir build=
 &amp;&amp;
cd    build &amp;&amp;

meson setup --prefix=3D/usr       \
            --buildtype=3Drelease \
            -D gtk=3Dtrue         \
            -D qt=3Dtrue          \
            -D buildstamp=3DBLFS  \
            -D libarchive=3Dtrue  \
            ..                  &amp;&amp;

ninja</kbd></pre>
                <p>
                  This package does not come with a test suite.
                </p>
                <p>
                  Now, as the <code class=3D"systemitem">root</code> user:
                </p>
                <pre class=3D"root"><kbd class=3D"command">ninja install</k=
bd></pre>
              </div>
              <div class=3D"sect3" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
                <div class=3D"titlepage">
                  <div>
                    <div>
                      <h4 class=3D"title">
                        <a id=3D"idm140470479407888" name=3D"idm14047047940=
7888"></a>Installation of Audacious
                        Plugins
                      </h4>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <p>
                  Install the required plugins package by issuing the
                  following commands:
                </p>
                <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">tar -xf ../=
../audacious-plugins-4.4.tar.bz2 &amp;&amp;
cd audacious-plugins-4.4                    &amp;&amp;

mkdir build &amp;&amp;
cd    build &amp;&amp;

meson setup           \
  --prefix=3D/usr       \
  --buildtype=3Drelease \
  -D gtk=3Dtrue         \
  -D qt=3Dtrue          \
  ..                  &amp;&amp;

ninja</kbd></pre>
                <p>
                  Now, as the <code class=3D"systemitem">root</code> user:
                </p>
                <pre class=3D"root"><kbd class=3D"command">ninja install</k=
bd></pre>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class=3D"commands" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Command Explanations
              </h3>
              <p>
                <em class=3D"parameter"><code>-D buildstamp=3DBLFS</code></=
em>:
                This switch appends the given text to the version string.
              </p>
              <p>
                <em class=3D"parameter"><code>-D gtk=3Dtrue</code></em>: Th=
is
                option enables GTK support for the graphical user interface=
.
              </p>
              <p>
                <em class=3D"parameter"><code>-D qt=3Dtrue</code></em>: Thi=
s
                option enables Qt support for the graphical user interface.
              </p>
              <p>
                <em class=3D"parameter"><code>-D libarchive=3Dtrue</code></=
em>:
                This adds libarchive support, for reading compressed module
                sets or skins.
              </p>
              <p>
                <code class=3D"option">-D valgrind=3Dtrue</code>: The optio=
n
                enables Valgrind analysis support.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class=3D"content" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
