          <div class=3D"sect1" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
            <div class=3D"package" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Introduction to CDParanoia
              </h3>
              <p>
                The <span class=3D"application">CDParanoia</span> package
                contains a CD audio extraction tool. This is useful for
                extracting <code class=3D"filename">.wav</code> files from
                audio CDs. A CDDA capable CDROM drive is needed. Practicall=
y
                all drives supported by Linux can be used.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
              </p>
              <h4>
                <a id=3D"idm140470479371376" name=3D"idm140470479371376"></=
