                <h3>
                  Note
                </h3>
                <p>
                  This package does not support parallel build.
                </p>
              </div>
              <p>
                Install <span class=3D"application">CDParanoia</span> by
                running the following commands:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">patch -Np1 -i=
 ../cdparanoia-III-10.2-gcc_fixes-1.patch &amp;&amp;
./configure --prefix=3D/usr --mandir=3D/usr/share/man &amp;&amp;
make -j1</kbd></pre>
              <p>
