                <h2 class=3D"title">
                  <a id=3D"lame" name=3D"lame"></a>LAME-3.100
                </h2>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class=3D"sect1" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
            <div class=3D"package" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Introduction to LAME
              </h3>
              <p>
                The <span class=3D"application">LAME</span> package contain=
s an
                MP3 encoder and optionally, an MP3 frame analyzer. This is
                useful for creating and analyzing compressed audio files.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
              </p>
              <h4>
                <a id=3D"idm140470479321616" name=3D"idm140470479321616"></=
a>Package Information
              </h4>
              <div class=3D"itemizedlist">
                <ul class=3D"compact">
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download (HTTP): <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://d=
ownloads.sourceforge.net/lame/lame-3.100.tar.gz">
                      https://downloads.sourceforge.net/lame/lame-3.100.tar=
.gz</a>
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download MD5 sum: 83e260acbe4389b54fe08e0bdbf7cddb
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download size: 1.5 MB
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Estimated disk space required: 9.7 MB
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Estimated build time: 0.1 SBU
                    </p>
                  </li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <h4>
                <a id=3D"idm140470479314208" name=3D"idm140470479314208"></=
a>LAME
                Dependencies
              </h4>
              <h5>
                <a id=3D"idm140470479313520" name=3D"idm140470479313520"></=
a>Optional
              </h5>
              <p class=3D"optional">
                <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://dmalloc.com/">Dmalloc</a=
>,
                <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://linux.softpedia.com/get/=
Programming/Debuggers/Electric-Fence-3305.shtml/">
                Electric Fence</a>, <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.l=
inuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html=
#libsndfile" title=3D"libsndfile-1.2.2">libsndfile-1.2.2</a> and <a class=
=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BL=
FS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#nasm" title=3D"NASM-2.16.03">NASM-2.16.03</=
a>
              </p>
              <p class=3D"usernotes">
                Editor Notes: <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://wiki.linux=
fromscratch.org/blfs/wiki/lame">https://wiki.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/wiki=
/lame</a>
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class=3D"installation" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Installation of LAME
              </h3>
              <p>
                Prevent the source code directory from being mistakenly
                hardcoded as a shared library search path in the installed
                programs:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">sed -i -e 's/=
^\(\s*hardcode_libdir_flag_spec\s*=3D\).*/\1/' configure</kbd></pre>
              <p>
                Install <span class=3D"application">LAME</span> by running =
the
                following commands:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">./configure -=
-prefix=3D/usr --enable-mp3rtp --disable-static &amp;&amp;
make</kbd></pre>
              <p>
                To test the results, issue: <span class=3D"command"><strong=
>LD_LIBRARY_PATH=3Dlibmp3lame/.libs make
                test</strong></span>.
              </p>
              <p>
                Now, as the <code class=3D"systemitem">root</code> user:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"root"><kbd class=3D"command">make pkghtmldir=3D=
/usr/share/doc/lame-3.100 install</kbd></pre>
            </div>
            <div class=3D"commands" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Command Explanations
              </h3>
              <p>
                <em class=3D"parameter"><code>--enable-mp3rtp</code></em>: =
This
                switch enables building the encode-to-RTP program.
              </p>
              <p>
                <em class=3D"parameter"><code>--disable-static</code></em>:
                This switch prevents installation of static versions of the
                libraries.
              </p>
              <p>
                <code class=3D"option">--enable-nasm</code>: This option
                enables the use of <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.li=
nuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#=
nasm" title=3D"NASM-2.16.03">NASM-2.16.03</a> to compile optimized assembly
                routines for 32-bit x86. Note that this has no effect on
                x86_64.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class=3D"content" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Contents
              </h3>
              <div class=3D"segmentedlist">
                <div class=3D"seglistitem">
                  <div class=3D"seg">
                    <strong class=3D"segtitle">Installed Programs:</strong>
                    <span class=3D"segbody">lame and mp3rtp</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class=3D"seg">
                    <strong class=3D"segtitle">Installed Library:</strong>
                    <span class=3D"segbody">libmp3lame.so</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class=3D"seg">
                    <strong class=3D"segtitle">Installed Directories:</stro=
ng>
                    <span class=3D"segbody">/usr/include/lame and
                    /usr/share/doc/lame-3.100</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class=3D"variablelist">
                <h4>
                  <a id=3D"idm140470479288512" name=3D"idm140470479288512">=
</a>Short Descriptions
                </h4>
                <table border=3D"0" class=3D"variablelist">
                  <colgroup>
                    <col align=3D"left" valign=3D"top">
                    <col>
                  </colgroup>
                  <tbody>
                    <tr>
                      <td>
                        <p>
                          <a id=3D"lame-prog" name=3D"lame-prog"></a><span =
class=3D"term"><span class=3D"command"><strong>lame</strong></span></span>
                        </p>
                      </td>
                      <td>
                        <p>
                          creates MP3 audio files from raw PCM or
                          <code class=3D"filename">.wav</code> data
                        </p>
                      </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                      <td>
                        <p>
                          <a id=3D"mp3rtp" name=3D"mp3rtp"></a><span class=
=3D"term"><span class=3D"command"><strong>mp3rtp</strong></span></span>
                        </p>
                      </td>
                      <td>
                        <p>
                          is used to encode MP3 with RTP streaming of the
                          output
                        </p>
                      </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                      <td>
                        <p>
                          <a id=3D"libmp3lame" name=3D"libmp3lame"></a><spa=
