              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Installation of mpv
              </h3>
              <p>
                Add a fix to build with FFMpeg &gt; 7.0
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">sed -i 's/AV_=
OPT_TYPE_CHANNEL_LAYOUT/AV_OPT_TYPE_CHLAYOUT/' filters/f_lavfi.c</kbd></pre=
>
              <p>
                Install <span class=3D"application">mpv</span> by running t=
he
                following commands:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">mkdir build &=
amp;&amp;
cd    build &amp;&amp;

meson setup --prefix=3D/usr       \
            --buildtype=3Drelease \
            -D x11=3Denabled      \
            ..                  &amp;&amp;
ninja</kbd></pre>
              <p>
                This package does not come with a test suite.
              </p>
              <p>
                Now, as the <code class=3D"systemitem">root</code> user:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"root"><kbd class=3D"command">ninja install</kbd=
></pre>
