          <div class=3D"sect1" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
            <div class=3D"package" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Introduction to Xine User Interface
              </h3>
              <p>
                The <span class=3D"application">xine User Interface</span>
                package contains a multimedia player. It plays back CDs, DV=
Ds
                and VCDs. It also decodes multimedia files like AVI, MOV,
                WMV, MPEG and MP3 from local disk drives, and displays
                multimedia streamed over the Internet.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
              </p>
              <div class=3D"admon note">
                <h3>
                  Note
                </h3>
                <p>
                  Although this version of xine-ui works with most files, i=
t
                  is unable to open encrypted (content-scrambled) DVDs with
                  the current version of libdvdcss.
                </p>
              </div>
              <h4>
                <a id=3D"idm140470478548832" name=3D"idm140470478548832"></=
a>Package Information
              </h4>
              <div class=3D"itemizedlist">
                <ul class=3D"compact">
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download (HTTP): <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://d=
ownloads.sourceforge.net/xine/xine-ui-0.99.14.tar.xz">
                      https://downloads.sourceforge.net/xine/xine-ui-0.99.1=
4.tar.xz</a>
                    </p>
                  </li>
