                Command Explanations
              </h3>
              <p>
                <em class=3D"parameter"><code>docsdir=3D/usr/share/doc/xine=
-ui-0.99.14</code></em>:
                This parameter causes the <span class=3D"application">Xine
                UI</span> documentation to be installed in the versioned
                directory <code class=3D"filename">/usr/share/doc/xine-ui-0=
.99.14</code>, rather that
                the default <code class=3D"filename">/usr/share/doc/xine-ui=
</code>.
              </p>
            </div>
