                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <p>
                  The above file is created and maintainable through the
                  <span class=3D"command"><strong>xine</strong></span> setu=
p
                  dialog box. The documentation for the configuration
                  settings is located at <code class=3D"filename">/usr/shar=
e/doc/xine-ui-0.99.14/README.config_en</code>.
                </p>
                <p>
                  If you have a DVB TV card, you can watch TV with the
                  command <span class=3D"command"><strong>xine
                  dvb://</strong></span> and change channels with the scrol=
l
                  wheel on your mouse.
                </p>
              </div>
