                Now, as the <code class=3D"systemitem">root</code> user:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"root"><kbd class=3D"command">GMAKE_NOWARN=3Dtru=
e &amp;&amp;

make INS_BASE=3D/usr    \
     DEFINSUSR=3Droot   \
     DEFINSGRP=3Droot   \
     MANSUFF_LIB=3D3cdr \
     install          &amp;&amp;

install -v -m755 -d /usr/share/doc/cdrtools-3.02a09 &amp;&amp;
install -v -m644 README.* READMEs/* ABOUT doc/*.ps \
                    /usr/share/doc/cdrtools-3.02a09</kbd></pre>
