              <p>
                <span class=3D"command"><strong>export
                GMAKE_NOWARN=3Dtrue</strong></span>: This variable avoids a
                warning when using GNU make.
              </p>
              <p>
                <em class=3D"parameter"><code>INS_BASE=3D/usr</code></em>: =
This
                parameter moves the install directory from <code class=3D"f=
ilename">/opt/schily</code> to <code class=3D"filename">/usr</code>.
              </p>
              <p>
                <em class=3D"parameter"><code>DEFINSUSR=3Droot
                DEFINSGRP=3Droot</code></em>: These parameters install all
                programs with root:root ownership instead of the default
                bin:bin.
              </p>
              <p>
                <em class=3D"parameter"><code>MANSUFF_LIB=3D3cdr</code></em=
>:
                This parameter prevents <span class=3D"application">Cdrtool=
s</span> from overwriting important
                pages which are already installed by LFS. The installed man
                pages of section 3 will have a suffix <code class=3D"litera=
l">3cdr</code> and can be shown using <span class=3D"command"><strong>man 3=
cdr &lt;manpage&gt;</strong></span>.
