              </h5>
              <p>
                <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/=
blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#cdrtools" title=3D"=
Cdrtools-3.02a09">Cdrtools-3.02a09</a> (runtime)
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class=3D"installation" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Installation of dvd+rw-tools
              </h3>
              <p>
                Install <span class=3D"application">dvd+rw-tools</span> by
                running the following commands:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">sed -i '/stat=
.h/a #include &lt;sys/sysmacros.h&gt;' growisofs.c &amp;&amp;
sed -i '/stdlib/a #include &lt;limits.h&gt;' transport.hxx &amp;&amp;
make all rpl8 btcflash</kbd></pre>
              <p>
                This package does not come with a test suite.
              </p>
              <p>
                Now, as the <code class=3D"systemitem">root</code> user:
              </p>
