      <div class=3D"part">
        <div class=3D"titlepage">
          <div>
            <div>
              <h2 class=3D"title">
                <a id=3D"pst-printing" name=3D"pst-printing"></a>Chapter&nb=
sp;46.&nbsp;Printing
              </h2>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class=3D"chapter" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
          <p>
            This chapter contains spooling printer management systems and
            ghostscript applications to render PostScript for display on
            terminals or paper.
          </p>
          <div class=3D"titlepage">
            <div>
              <div>
                <h2 class=3D"title">
                  <a id=3D"cups" name=3D"cups"></a>Cups-2.4.10
                </h2>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class=3D"sect1" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
            <div class=3D"package" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Introduction to Cups
              </h3>
              <p>
                The Common Unix Printing System (CUPS) is a print spooler a=
nd
                associated utilities. It is based on the "Internet Printing
                Protocol" and provides printing services to most PostScript
                and raster printers.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
              </p>
              <h4>
                <a id=3D"idm140470478064656" name=3D"idm140470478064656"></=
a>Package Information
              </h4>
              <div class=3D"itemizedlist">
                <ul class=3D"compact">
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download (HTTP): <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://g=
ithub.com/OpenPrinting/cups/releases/download/v2.4.10/cups-2.4.10-source.ta=
r.gz">
                      https://github.com/OpenPrinting/cups/releases/downloa=
d/v2.4.10/cups-2.4.10-source.tar.gz</a>
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download MD5 sum: 0e8b1227340e4aeca22b9fbbcd6ca5cd
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download size: 7.8 MB
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Estimated disk space required: 60 MB (Add 49 MB for
                      tests)
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Estimated build time: 0.4 SBU (Add 1.0 SBU for tests)
                    </p>
                  </li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <h4>
                <a id=3D"idm140470478057264" name=3D"idm140470478057264"></=
a>Cups
                Dependencies
              </h4>
              <h5>
                <a id=3D"idm140470478056576" name=3D"idm140470478056576"></=
a>Required
              </h5>
              <p class=3D"required">
                <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/=
blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#gnutls" title=3D"Gn=
uTLS-3.8.7.1">GnuTLS-3.8.7.1</a>
              </p>
              <h5>
                <a id=3D"idm140470478054592" name=3D"idm140470478054592"></=
a>Recommended
              </h5>
              <p class=3D"recommended">
                <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/=
blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#colord" title=3D"Co=
lord-1.4.7">colord-1.4.7</a>, <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfr=
omscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#dbus"=
 title=3D"dbus-1.14.10">dbus-1.14.10</a>, <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https:/=
/www.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunk=
s.html#libusb" title=3D"libusb-1.0.27">libusb-1.0.27</a>, <a class=3D"xref"=
 href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-1=
2.2-sysv-nochunks.html#linux-pam" title=3D"Linux-PAM-1.6.1">Linux-PAM-1.6.1=
</a>, and <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/d=
ownloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#xdg-utils" title=3D"xdg-u=
tils-1.2.1">xdg-utils-1.2.1</a>
              </p>
              <h5>
                <a id=3D"idm140470478049920" name=3D"idm140470478049920"></=
a>Optional
              </h5>
              <p class=3D"optional">
                <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/=
blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#avahi" title=3D"Ava=
hi-0.8">Avahi-0.8</a>, <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscrat=
ch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#libpaper" ti=
tle=3D"libpaper-2.2.5">libpaper-2.2.5</a>, <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https:=
//www.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochun=
ks.html#mitkrb" title=3D"MIT Kerberos V5-1.21.3">MIT Kerberos
                V5-1.21.3</a>, <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxf=
romscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#php"=
 title=3D"PHP-8.3.10">PHP-8.3.10</a>, and <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https:=
//www.python.org/downloads/release/python-2718/">Python2</a>
              </p>
