          <div class=3D"sect1" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
            <div class=3D"package" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Introduction to cups-browsed
              </h3>
              <p>
                The <span class=3D"application">cups-browsed</span> daemon =
is
                used to browse the network for remote CUPS queues and IPP
                network printers and automatically create local queues
                pointing to them.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
              </p>
              <h4>
                <a id=3D"idm140470477790720" name=3D"idm140470477790720"></=
a>Package Information
              </h4>
              <div class=3D"itemizedlist">
                <ul class=3D"compact">
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download (HTTP): <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://g=
ithub.com/OpenPrinting/cups-browsed/releases/download/2.0.1/cups-browsed-2.=
0.1.tar.xz">
                      https://github.com/OpenPrinting/cups-browsed/releases=
/download/2.0.1/cups-browsed-2.0.1.tar.xz</a>
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download MD5 sum: b6b5bad9b3bb52afb687702e0b3f6d02
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download size: 420 KB
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Estimated disk space required: 6.1 MB
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Estimated build time: less than 0.1 SBU (Using
                      parallelism=3D4)
                    </p>
                  </li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <h4>
                <a id=3D"idm140470477783248" name=3D"idm140470477783248"></=
a>cups-browsed Dependencies
              </h4>
              <h5>
                <a id=3D"idm140470477782544" name=3D"idm140470477782544"></=
a>Required
              </h5>
              <p class=3D"required">
                <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/=
