          <div class=3D"sect1" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
            <div class=3D"package" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Introduction to Gutenprint
              </h3>
              <p>
                The <span class=3D"application">Gutenprint</span> (formerly
                <span class=3D"application">Gimp-Print</span>) package cont=
ains
                high quality drivers for many brands and models of printers
                for use with <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfro=
mscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#cups" =
title=3D"Cups-2.4.10">Cups-2.4.10</a>. See a list of supported
                printers at <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://gutenprint.s=
ourceforge.net/p_Supported_Printers.php">
                https://gutenprint.sourceforge.net/p_Supported_Printers.php=
</a>.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
              </p>
              <h4>
                <a id=3D"idm140470477578880" name=3D"idm140470477578880"></=
a>Package Information
              </h4>
              <div class=3D"itemizedlist">
                <ul class=3D"compact">
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download (HTTP): <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://d=
ownloads.sourceforge.net/gimp-print/gutenprint-5.3.4.tar.xz">
                      https://downloads.sourceforge.net/gimp-print/gutenpri=
nt-5.3.4.tar.xz</a>
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download MD5 sum: dc208cfb873f13a93439185c15aa6f81
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download size: 5.1 MB
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
