                  <tbody>
                    <tr>
                      <td>
                        <p>
                          <a id=3D"gamma4scanimage" name=3D"gamma4scanimage=
"></a><span class=3D"term"><span class=3D"command"><strong>gamma4scanimage<=
/strong></span></span>
                        </p>
                      </td>
                      <td>
                        <p>
                          creates a gamma table in the format expected by
                          <span class=3D"command"><strong>scanimage</strong=
></span>
                        </p>
                      </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                      <td>
                        <p>
                          <a id=3D"sane-config-prog" name=3D"sane-config-pr=
og"></a><span class=3D"term"><span class=3D"command"><strong>sane-config</s=
trong></span></span>
                        </p>
                      </td>
                      <td>
                        <p>
                          is a tool used to determine the compiler and link=
er
                          flags that should be used to compile and link
                          <span class=3D"application">SANE</span>
                        </p>
                      </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                      <td>
                        <p>
                          <a id=3D"saned" name=3D"saned"></a><span class=3D=
"term"><span class=3D"command"><strong>saned</strong></span></span>
                        </p>
                      </td>
                      <td>
                        <p>
                          is the <span class=3D"application">SANE</span> da=
emon
                          that allows remote clients to access image
                          acquisition devices available on the local host
                        </p>
                      </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                      <td>
                        <p>
                          <a id=3D"sane-find-scanner" name=3D"sane-find-sca=
nner"></a><span class=3D"term"><span class=3D"command"><strong>sane-find-sc=
anner</strong></span></span>
                        </p>
                      </td>
                      <td>
                        <p>
                          is a command-line tool to find SCSI and USB
                          scanners and determine their device files. Its
                          primary purpose is to make sure that scanners can
                          be detected by <span class=3D"application">SANE</=
span> backends
                        </p>
                      </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                      <td>
                        <p>
                          <a id=3D"scanimage" name=3D"scanimage"></a><span =
class=3D"term"><span class=3D"command"><strong>scanimage</strong></span></s=
pan>
                        </p>
                      </td>
                      <td>
                        <p>
                          is a command line interface for scanning from ima=
ge
                          acquisition devices such as flatbed scanners or
                          cameras. It is also used to list the available
                          backend devices
                        </p>
                      </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                      <td>
                        <p>
                          <a id=3D"umax_pp" name=3D"umax_pp"></a><span clas=
s=3D"term"><span class=3D"command"><strong>umax_pp</strong></span></span>
                        </p>
                      </td>
                      <td>
                        <p>
                          is a tool used to read information from UMAX
                          parallel port scanners. It can also be used for
                          performing diagnostics on these scanners
                        </p>
                      </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                      <td>
                        <p>
                          <a id=3D"libsane" name=3D"libsane"></a><span clas=
s=3D"term"><code class=3D"filename">libsane.so</code></span>
                        </p>
                      </td>
                      <td>
                        <p>
                          is the application programming interface that is
                          used to communicate between frontends and backend=
s
                        </p>
                      </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                      <td>
                        <p>
                          <a id=3D"libsane-module" name=3D"libsane-module">=
</a><span class=3D"term"><code class=3D"filename">libsane-*.so</code></span=
>
                        </p>
                      </td>
                      <td>
                        <p>
                          modules are backend scanning library plugins used
                          to interface with scanning devices. See <a class=
=3D"ulink" href=3D"http://www.sane-project.org/sane-supported-devices.html"=
>
                          http://www.sane-project.org/sane-supported-device=
s.html</a>
                          for a list of supported backends
                        </p>
                      </td>
                    </tr>
                  </tbody>
                </table>
              </div>
