          <div class=3D"titlepage">
            <div>
              <div>
                <h2 class=3D"title">
                  <a id=3D"simple-scan" name=3D"simple-scan"></a>Simple-sca=
n-46.0
                </h2>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class=3D"sect1" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
            <div class=3D"package" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Introduction to Simple-scan
              </h3>
              <p>
                The <span class=3D"application">Simple-scan</span> package
                contains a modern document scanning application. It capture=
s
                images using SANE, and supports the latest color management
                and graphics standards.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
              </p>
              <h4>
                <a id=3D"idm140470477220784" name=3D"idm140470477220784"></=
a>Package Information
              </h4>
              <div class=3D"itemizedlist">
                <ul class=3D"compact">
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download (HTTP): <a class=3D"ulink" href=3D"https://d=
ownload.gnome.org/sources/simple-scan/46/simple-scan-46.0.tar.xz">
                      https://download.gnome.org/sources/simple-scan/46/sim=
ple-scan-46.0.tar.xz</a>
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download MD5 sum: 5ae9ca4d4c59520736c11a2eb427502d
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Download size: 1.1 MB
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
                    <p>
                      Estimated disk space required: 27 MB
                    </p>
                  </li>
                  <li class=3D"listitem">
