                    </p>
                  </li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <h4>
                <a id=3D"idm140470477213360" name=3D"idm140470477213360"></=
a>Simple-scan Dependencies
              </h4>
              <h5>
                <a id=3D"idm140470477212656" name=3D"idm140470477212656"></=
a>Required
              </h5>
              <p class=3D"required">
                <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/=
blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#colord" title=3D"Co=
lord-1.4.7">colord-1.4.7</a>, <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfr=
omscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#itsto=
