pan>
                by running the following commands:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">sed -i -e '/I=
SO 8879/d' \
       -e 's|DTDDECL "-//OASIS//DTD DocBook V3.1//EN"|SGMLDECL|g' \
       docbook.cat</kbd></pre>
              <p>
