          <div class=3D"sect1" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
            <div class=3D"package" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Introduction to OpenSP
              </h3>
              <p>
                The <span class=3D"application">OpenSP</span> package conta=
ins
                a <span class=3D"application">C++</span> library for using
                SGML/XML files. This is useful for validating, parsing and
                manipulating SGML and XML documents.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
              </p>
              <h4>
                <a id=3D"idm140470476987328" name=3D"idm140470476987328"></=
a>Package Information
