            <div class=3D"installation" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Installation of DocBook DSSSL Stylesheets
              </h3>
              <p>
                If you downloaded the documentation, run:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"userinput"><kbd class=3D"command">tar -xf ../do=
cbook-dsssl-doc-1.79.tar.bz2 --strip-components=3D1</kbd></pre>
              <p>
                Install <span class=3D"application">DocBook DSSSL
                Stylesheets</span> by running the following commands as the
                <code class=3D"systemitem">root</code> user:
              </p>
              <pre class=3D"root"><kbd class=3D"command">install -v -m755 b=
in/collateindex.pl /usr/bin                      &amp;&amp;
install -v -m644 bin/collateindex.pl.1 /usr/share/man/man1         &amp;&am=
p;
install -v -d -m755 /usr/share/sgml/docbook/dsssl-stylesheets-1.79 &amp;&am=
p;
cp -v -R * /usr/share/sgml/docbook/dsssl-stylesheets-1.79          &amp;&am=
p;

install-catalog --add /etc/sgml/dsssl-docbook-stylesheets.cat \
    /usr/share/sgml/docbook/dsssl-stylesheets-1.79/catalog         &amp;&am=
p;

install-catalog --add /etc/sgml/dsssl-docbook-stylesheets.cat \
    /usr/share/sgml/docbook/dsssl-stylesheets-1.79/common/catalog  &amp;&am=
p;

install-catalog --add /etc/sgml/sgml-docbook.cat              \
    /etc/sgml/dsssl-docbook-stylesheets.cat</kbd></pre>
