              </h3>
              <p>
                <span class=3D"application">Enscript</span> converts ASCII =
text
                files to PostScript, HTML, RTF, ANSI and overstrikes.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
              </p>
