t
                  UTF-8 encoded text to PostScript. The issue is discussed =
in
                  detail in the <a class=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linux=
fromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BLFS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#loc=
ale-not-valid-option" title=3D"The Needed Encoding is Not a Valid Option in=
 the Program">Needed
