=3D"xref" href=3D"https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/blfs/downloads/stable/BL=
FS-BOOK-12.2-sysv-nochunks.html#locale-issues" title=3D"Locale Related Issu=
es">Locale Related Issues</a> page. The
