                <em class=3D"parameter"><code>--sysconfdir=3D/etc/enscript<=
/code></em>:
                This switch puts configuration data in <code class=3D"filen=
ame">/etc/enscript</code> instead of <code class=3D"filename">/usr/etc</cod=
e>.
              </p>
              <p>
                <em class=3D"parameter"><code>--localstatedir=3D/var</code>=
</em>:
                This switch sets the directory for runtime data to
                <code class=3D"filename">/var</code> instead of <code class=
=3D"filename">/usr/var</code>.
              </p>
              <p>
                <em class=3D"parameter"><code>--with-media=3DLetter</code><=
/em>:
                This switch sets the medium format to letter size instead o=
f
                the A4 default.
              </p>
