                Command Explanations
              </h3>
              <p>
                <span class=3D"command"><strong>-D
                enable-printing=3Dtrue</strong></span>: builds the code to =
link
                to the <span class=3D"application">cups</span> print queue(=
s).
                Omit this if you have not installed <span class=3D"applicat=
ion">cups</span>.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class=3D"configuration" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Configuring ePDFView-gtk3
              </h3>
              <p>
                ePDFView-gtk3 has several keyboard hotkeys for optional
                features. Most of them are 'off' by default, including the
                toolbar, and if it has been closed with the menu disabled,
                the program can start with all options not being visible
                until the relevant function keys are pressed.
              </p>
