cts
                Processor) package contains a print formatter driven by XSL
                formatting objects (XSL-FO). It is a <span class=3D"applica=
tion">Java</span> application that reads a formatting
                object tree and renders the resulting pages to a specified
                output. Output formats currently supported include PDF, PCL=
,
                PostScript, SVG, XML (area tree representation), print, AWT=
,
                MIF and ASCII text. The primary output target is PDF.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
              </p>
