                  </tbody>
                </table>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class=3D"titlepage">
            <div>
              <div>
                <h2 class=3D"title">
                  <a id=3D"asymptote" name=3D"asymptote"></a>asymptote-2.91
                </h2>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class=3D"sect1" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
            <div class=3D"package" lang=3D"en" xml:lang=3D"en">
              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Introduction to asymptote
              </h3>
              <p>
                <span class=3D"application">Asymptote</span> is a powerful
                descriptive vector graphics language that provides a natura=
l
                coordinate-based framework for technical drawing. Labels an=
d
                equations can be typeset with LaTeX. As well as EPS, PDF, a=
nd
                PNG output, it can produce WebGL 3D HTML rendering and (usi=
