              <h3 class=3D"sect2">
                Introduction to biber
              </h3>
              <p>
                Biber is a BibTeX replacement for users of biblatex, writte=
n
                in <span class=3D"application">Perl</span>, with full Unico=
de
                support.
              </p>
              <p>
                This package is known to build and work properly using an L=
FS
                12.2 platform.
              </p>
